00:10:36,719 --> 00:10:41,682
‪I don't know if this is
‪a romantic interest or not,

231
00:10:42,433 --> 00:10:44,435
‪but I keep finding myself looking at you.

232
00:10:44,518 --> 00:10:48,022
‪You're funny, and I'm curious about you.

233
00:10:48,105 --> 00:10:53,027
‪But if I got a chance
‪to go on a date with someone,

234
00:10:54,028 --> 00:10:55,321
‪I would probably go out

235
00:10:57,114 --> 00:10:58,366
‪with my first choice.

236
00:10:59,325 --> 00:11:00,826
‪-What about you?
‪-Me?

237
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,995
‪From the moment I got here,

238
00:11:04,455 --> 00:11:05,790
‪I've been curious about you.

239
00:11:05,873 --> 00:11:07,458
‪-Me?
‪-Yeah.

240
00:11:07,541 --> 00:11:11,003
‪I came here to tell you that I want to go
‪on a date with you tomorrow.

241
00:11:11,837 --> 00:11:15,132
‪You may be confused because of how things

242
00:11:15,883 --> 00:11:17,760
‪are going between me and Ye-rim.

243
00:11:17,843 --> 00:11:18,761
‪-I…
‪-You two seemed

244
00:11:19,970 --> 00:11:22,181
‪very certain about each other.

245
00:11:22,264 --> 00:11:23,474
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

246
00:11:25,059 --> 00:11:25,976
‪I thought

247
00:11:26,811 --> 00:11:28,187
‪it was clear too.

248
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,606
‪No, it was never clear for me.

249
00:11:30,689 --> 00:11:33,359
‪Honestly,
‪I was curious about both you and Ye-rim.

250
00:11:33,442 --> 00:11:37,488
‪But since I was more curious about Ye-rim,
‪I went on a date with her first.

251
00:11:38,531 --> 00:11:40,699
‪I was curious about you
‪from the start too.

252
00:11:42,243 --> 00:11:43,786
‪I just wanted to go on a date with you.

253
00:11:44,495 --> 00:11:47,581
‪He suddenly said something that was
‪almost like a confession of his feelings.

254
00:11:47,665 --> 00:11:51,502
‪I couldn't help but keep looking at him,
‪but we didn't have a chance to chat.

255
00:11:51,585 --> 00:11:53,129
‪So when he told me that,

256
00:11:53,212 --> 00:11:55,673
‪I realized that it wasn't just me
‪who felt that way.

257
00:11:55,756 --> 00:11:57,800
‪Anyway, I didn't think I'd get a chance

258
00:11:58,843 --> 00:12:02,805
‪to tell you if I didn't do it today.

259
00:12:02,888 --> 00:12:05,933
‪That's why I really wanted to be king.

260
00:12:07,309 --> 00:12:09,353
‪-You already got to be king.
‪-I did.

261
00:12:09,437 --> 00:12:11,730
‪You prevented me from going on a date.

262
00:12:13,524 --> 00:12:14,984
‪Actually, that was…

263
00:12:15,776 --> 00:12:16,652
‪It was on purpose?

264
00:12:17,903 --> 00:12:20,197
‪I was being childish when I did that.

265
00:12:21,866 --> 00:12:23,033
‪I'm serious.

266
00:12:24,201 --> 00:12:25,870
‪I'm allowed to be a bit greedy, right?

267
00:12:25,953 --> 00:12:28,038
‪Our eyes kept meeting, didn't they?

268
00:12:28,122 --> 00:12:29,707
‪It wasn't in my head, right?

269
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:33,752
‪-You kept glaring at me.
‪-You know,

270
00:12:33,836 --> 00:12:36,213
‪when I look into people's eyes,

271
00:12:36,297 --> 00:12:38,340
‪-they avoid it.
‪-Yeah.

272
00:12:38,424 --> 00:12:40,801
‪But you never looked away.

273
00:12:40,885 --> 00:12:41,969
‪No.

274
00:12:42,052 --> 00:12:45,639
‪-You'd stare at me intensely.
‪-Yeah.

275
00:12:50,144 --> 00:12:52,605
‪-Why?
‪-What?

276
00:12:56,025 --> 00:13:00,529
<i>‪You were the person</i>
<i>‪where my eyes kept landing on.</i>

277
00:13:00,613 --> 00:13:01,780
‪To be honest,

278
00:13:02,781 --> 00:13:04,158
‪you have the face

279
00:13:05,034 --> 00:13:08,287
‪that is really my type.

280
00:13:08,370 --> 00:13:09,872
‪-My face?
‪-Yeah.

281
00:13:12,541 --> 00:13:13,959
‪Don't take that as a confession.

282
00:13:14,043 --> 00:13:14,877
‪Not at all.

283
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:18,881
‪-Me too. Honestly, I'm just curious.
‪-I'm just telling you how I feel.

284
00:13:18,964 --> 00:13:21,675
‪-We're curious.
‪-I'm curious so I want to go out with you.

285
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:24,637
‪I also have to give Ye-rim an answer.

286
00:13:25,262 --> 00:13:29,683
‪But without tying up
‪the loose ends with you,

287
00:13:29,767 --> 00:13:34,146
‪I don't want to give an answer to Ye-rim,
‪whether it's yes or no.

288
00:13:34,939 --> 00:13:37,233
‪I don't know. I just want to
‪go on a date with you.

289
00:13:38,484 --> 00:13:41,695
‪I thought Ga-yeon must've been
‪completely clueless about how I felt.

290
00:13:41,779 --> 00:13:44,156
‪To be honest,
‪I think just that was enough.

291
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,575
‪The fact that he called me over to talk

292
00:13:46,659 --> 00:13:48,118
‪was a huge statement in itself.

293
00:13:48,202 --> 00:13:50,204
‪It's as big as Jung-min holding my hand.

294
00:13:50,287 --> 00:13:51,622
‪My heart was racing.

295
00:13:51,705 --> 00:13:54,041
‪Because it's not like
‪I had no interest in him at all.

296
00:13:54,124 --> 00:13:55,584
‪So my heart fluttered a lot.

297
00:13:56,085 --> 00:13:58,087
‪Let's chat.

298
00:13:58,170 --> 00:13:59,630
‪Even if it isn't a date?

299
00:13:59,713 --> 00:14:01,340
‪-A date would be nice.
‪-Yeah.

300
00:14:01,882 --> 00:14:03,801
‪WHILE GA-YEON WAS CALLED AWAY,
‪DO-GEON WENT TO SEE JUNG-MIN

301
00:14:03,884 --> 00:14:05,177
‪Can I ask you something?

302
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:07,638
‪How many people are you interested in?

303
00:14:08,847 --> 00:14:10,057
‪All of a sudden?

304
00:14:10,140 --> 00:14:11,475
‪So far, there's only one.

305
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:13,269
‪-One person you're sure about?
‪-Yeah, Ga-yeon.

306
00:14:13,352 --> 00:14:16,730
‪I found Ga-yeon really compatible with me.

307
00:14:16,814 --> 00:14:17,773
‪What about you?

308
00:14:18,357 --> 00:14:19,400
‪It's Chae-rin for me.

309
00:14:19,483 --> 00:14:20,818
‪Yeah, I think you only have one too.

310
00:14:20,901 --> 00:14:23,153
‪Of course, I'm sure about Chae-rin.

311
00:14:23,237 --> 00:14:24,363
‪I sense a "but."

312
00:14:24,446 --> 00:14:28,826
‪But the person that I want to get to know

313
00:14:29,493 --> 00:14:30,536
‪is Ga-yeon.

314
00:14:30,619 --> 00:14:31,704
‪Really?

315
00:14:32,872 --> 00:14:34,331
‪Hey, man.

316
00:14:34,415 --> 00:14:35,499
‪You're making me nervous.

317
00:14:36,792 --> 00:14:38,502
‪He should've been nervous before that.

318
00:14:38,586 --> 00:14:40,296
‪You should've been nervous
‪when they went to that tent!

319
00:14:40,379 --> 00:14:41,714
‪Now is not the time for a face mask!

320
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:44,425
‪-You know what? Jung-min is so innocent.
‪-Right!

321
00:14:44,508 --> 00:14:45,634
‪He's a really good guy.

322
00:14:45,718 --> 00:14:48,929
‪He doesn't have anyone else
‪he wants to get to know better.

323
00:14:49,013 --> 00:14:50,848
‪He only has eyes for Ga-yeon.

324
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:52,766
‪Hey, man.

325
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:54,143
‪You're making me nervous.

326
00:14:56,854 --> 00:14:58,022
‪For real?

327
00:14:58,105 --> 00:15:00,941
‪But after today,
‪I think I'll be able to make up my mind.

328
00:15:01,525 --> 00:15:02,568
‪I'll come barging in later.

329
00:15:03,694 --> 00:15:04,528
‪Anytime.

330
00:15:04,612 --> 00:15:07,156
‪But you may have to hurry.

331
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:09,074
‪-Why?
‪-Right now…

332
00:15:13,329 --> 00:15:16,373
‪RETURNS TO THE TENT

333
00:15:16,457 --> 00:15:19,168
‪-Is Do-geon lying down?
‪-Yeah, he's over there.

334
00:15:20,044 --> 00:15:21,337
‪Can I take a look?

335
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:23,547
‪-I was checking the temperature.
‪-He wants to join.

336
00:15:23,631 --> 00:15:25,049
‪-No.
‪-Should the three of us sleep together?

337
00:15:25,132 --> 00:15:27,885
‪-No, that's not it at all.
‪-In the middle.

338
00:15:28,469 --> 00:15:29,929
‪I'll sleep in the middle.

339
00:15:30,012 --> 00:15:32,097
‪-Sleeping here must be really nice.
‪-Really?

340
00:15:32,181 --> 00:15:33,974
‪-It isn't as bad as it seems.
‪-Right.

341
00:15:34,058 --> 00:15:37,561
‪Anyway, don't freeze to death, you two.
‪See you alive.

342
00:15:37,645 --> 00:15:39,438
‪-I'll get going.
‪-Good night.

343
00:15:39,521 --> 00:15:40,397
‪Bye.

344
00:15:41,857 --> 00:15:43,025
‪You're popular.

345
00:15:43,108 --> 00:15:44,360
‪No.

346
00:15:44,443 --> 00:15:45,611
‪What did you talk about?

347
00:15:46,236 --> 00:15:49,239
‪He said he has been wanting to
‪have a conversation with me.

348
00:15:49,323 --> 00:15:51,241
‪Are you set on someone?

349
00:15:52,660 --> 00:15:53,577
‪First of all,

350
00:15:54,578 --> 00:15:59,917
‪the person that I have
‪the strongest romantic interest in

351
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,085
‪is Jung-min.

352
00:16:01,168 --> 00:16:02,002
‪KYUNG-HO CAME TO SEE JUNG-MIN

353
00:16:02,086 --> 00:16:03,754
‪I have something to tell you.

354
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:05,506
‪-Really?
‪-Yes.

355
00:16:05,589 --> 00:16:09,593
‪Why does everyone have something
‪to tell me? Starting with Do-geon.

356
00:16:09,677 --> 00:16:11,220
‪It isn't something you'd like to hear.

357
00:16:11,303 --> 00:16:12,888
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

358
00:16:12,972 --> 00:16:14,306
‪It's just how I feel.

359
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:18,394
‪I've been interested in Ga-yeon
‪from the start as well.

360
00:16:18,477 --> 00:16:20,479
‪Really? Okay.

361
00:16:21,772 --> 00:16:24,358
‪I've been curious about Ga-yeon.

362
00:16:25,025 --> 00:16:29,446
‪I pulled her aside and told her just now

363
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:31,407
‪that I would like to
‪go on a date with her.

364
00:16:31,490 --> 00:16:34,535
‪But that's just how I feel.

365
00:16:34,618 --> 00:16:37,538
‪I just came here to tell you
‪that I told her that.

366
00:16:39,456 --> 00:16:40,833
‪Thanks for letting me know.

367
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:44,253
‪I feel like I can't just sit back
‪and do nothing now.

368
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:46,463
‪Right. Honestly…

369
00:16:46,547 --> 00:16:47,464
‪This is hilarious.

370
00:16:47,548 --> 00:16:49,425
‪I didn't want to be underhanded about it.

371
00:16:49,508 --> 00:16:50,676
‪This is interesting.

372
00:16:50,759 --> 00:16:52,720
‪Another one came. It was Kyung-ho.

373
00:16:52,803 --> 00:16:55,264
‪I realized right then
‪that I shouldn't just sit back.

374
00:16:55,347 --> 00:16:56,724
‪I should do something.

375
00:16:58,308 --> 00:16:59,727
‪I need to have a chat with Ga-yeon.

376
00:17:00,561 --> 00:17:03,939
‪THE PHANTOM OF GANGHWADO RUSHES OUT

377
00:17:04,023 --> 00:17:05,274
‪He's going out too?

378
00:17:05,357 --> 00:17:07,067
‪Ga-yeon's getting summoned again?

379
00:17:07,151 --> 00:17:07,985
‪What about Do-geon?

380
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:10,821
‪I just couldn't get
‪paired up with Jung-min, so…

381
00:17:10,904 --> 00:17:13,365
‪My closest friend is…

382
00:17:14,074 --> 00:17:15,075
‪-Ga-yeon!
‪-Yeah?

383
00:17:16,869 --> 00:17:18,704
‪-You have a face mask on?
‪-Who's that? Are you on the left?

384
00:17:18,787 --> 00:17:20,330
‪Okay, there you are.

385
00:17:20,414 --> 00:17:21,749
‪Aren't you cold?

386
00:17:21,832 --> 00:17:23,417
‪-I'm fine with this on.
‪-Really?

387
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:26,128
‪I was about to go to bed,
‪but I came out to have a chat with you.

388
00:17:27,337 --> 00:17:28,756
‪What is that?

389
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:30,674
‪You want me to chat with you
‪looking like that?

390
00:17:31,258 --> 00:17:32,593
‪-Shall we talk?
‪-Okay.

391
00:17:32,676 --> 00:17:34,178
‪I'll be back.

392
00:17:34,261 --> 00:17:37,014
‪-Go on inside.
‪-Okay, I'll be inside.

393
00:17:39,433 --> 00:17:40,476
‪Man, this face mask.

394
00:17:40,559 --> 00:17:41,685
‪Take it off.

395
00:17:41,769 --> 00:17:44,146
‪-I don't think we can chat with that on.
‪-Right.

396
00:17:44,229 --> 00:17:45,981
‪-Gosh, Ga-yeon.
‪-Yeah?

397
00:17:46,065 --> 00:17:48,692
‪-All the guys have come to see me.
‪-Why?

398
00:17:48,776 --> 00:17:49,818
‪They like you.

399
00:17:49,902 --> 00:17:52,988
‪-Why are they being like this suddenly?
‪-I know.

400
00:17:53,072 --> 00:17:55,616
‪-What are they talking about?
‪-I know.

401
00:17:55,699 --> 00:17:58,327
‪I want to know how you feel.
‪I honestly don't care about the guys.

402
00:17:58,410 --> 00:18:01,955
‪If I'm going to be
‪completely honest with you,

403
00:18:02,748 --> 00:18:07,294
‪you are the only person
‪I'm romantically interested in.

404
00:18:07,377 --> 00:18:09,296
‪The one I have
‪clear feelings for, that is.

405
00:18:09,379 --> 00:18:12,382
‪How many times do I have to hear
‪that Jung-min is her first choice?

406
00:18:12,466 --> 00:18:14,968
‪She said like ten times
‪that she doesn't know if it's romantic

407
00:18:15,052 --> 00:18:17,054
‪but she keeps looking at Kyung-ho!

408
00:18:17,137 --> 00:18:18,305
‪Make it stop!

409
00:18:18,388 --> 00:18:19,890
‪The problem is the "but."

410
00:18:19,973 --> 00:18:21,475
‪-But…
‪-But?

411
00:18:21,558 --> 00:18:23,102
‪-Yeah, but?
‪-But…

412
00:18:24,311 --> 00:18:26,105
‪-I find myself
‪-Yes.

413
00:18:27,106 --> 00:18:29,775
‪-keep looking at Kyung-ho.
‪-I see.

414
00:18:29,858 --> 00:18:34,655
‪And I think the way
‪he jokes around is funny.

415
00:18:34,738 --> 00:18:41,745
‪But I really don't know
‪if this is romantic interest or not.

416
00:18:41,829 --> 00:18:47,042
‪But I know for sure is that
‪you are my first choice at the moment.

417
00:18:47,126 --> 00:18:51,255
‪Then, who do you think is the right person
‪for you to go on a date with tomorrow?

418
00:18:51,338 --> 00:18:54,842
‪I already told this to Hye-won.

419
00:18:54,925 --> 00:18:56,927
‪-Tomorrow?
‪-I said I want to go out with you.

420
00:18:57,010 --> 00:19:00,264
‪As for me,
‪there's no second choice at the moment.

421
00:19:00,347 --> 00:19:01,473
‪-So far.
‪-There's only me?

422
00:19:01,557 --> 00:19:02,850
‪-For me, yes.
‪-You can talk

423
00:19:02,933 --> 00:19:03,976
‪-to someone.
‪-There's no second choice.

424
00:19:04,059 --> 00:19:05,727
‪You're the only one for me right now.

425
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:09,731
‪I came to see you immediately
‪because I didn't want to lose you.

426
00:19:09,815 --> 00:19:11,066
‪He said there's no second choice.

427
00:19:11,150 --> 00:19:14,153
‪He reassured me
‪by being straightforward to me.

428
00:19:14,236 --> 00:19:18,615
‪What Jung-min said made
‪my heart flutter a bit more.

429
00:19:18,699 --> 00:19:20,409
‪Hang out with me tomorrow.

430
00:19:20,492 --> 00:19:22,911
‪I want to.
‪And I think it'll turn out that way.

431
00:19:22,995 --> 00:19:26,707
‪I think Hye-won is willing
‪to make things happen for me.

432
00:19:26,790 --> 00:19:27,624
‪You're right.

433
00:19:28,125 --> 00:19:32,337
‪From what I can get,
‪Kyung-ho hasn't voted for me.

434
00:19:32,838 --> 00:19:33,672
‪He voted for her.

435
00:19:33,755 --> 00:19:35,549
‪He voted for me yesterday and today.

436
00:19:35,632 --> 00:19:39,386
‪But along with those hearts,

437
00:19:39,469 --> 00:19:41,805
‪he gave me a bunch of negative hearts.

438
00:19:41,889 --> 00:19:45,517
‪That means he doesn't want me
‪to be king no matter what.

439
00:19:46,393 --> 00:19:48,979
‪And I know why he did that.

440
00:19:49,062 --> 00:19:52,441
‪It's because I told him
‪I would choose him if it were up to me.

441
00:19:52,524 --> 00:19:56,111
‪He didn't want that to happen,
‪and that's probably why--

442
00:19:56,195 --> 00:20:00,324
‪You don't know for sure that
‪Kyung-ho gave you the negative hearts.

443
00:20:00,407 --> 00:20:05,495
‪I couldn't think of anyone besides him
‪who would give me those.

444
00:20:05,579 --> 00:20:08,332
‪He gave me a bunch of negative hearts
‪so I couldn't pick him.

445
00:20:08,415 --> 00:20:10,334
‪-No.
‪-No.

446
00:20:10,417 --> 00:20:13,003
‪-Really? Why? It makes total sense to me.
‪-No, that's not it.

447
00:20:13,086 --> 00:20:13,921
‪Why not?

448
00:20:14,004 --> 00:20:16,089
‪-Come on.
‪-Look.

449
00:20:16,173 --> 00:20:17,716
‪I'm sorry, but ladies.

450
00:20:17,799 --> 00:20:20,052
‪-Don't make her a fool. Just tell her.
‪-Exactly!

451
00:20:20,135 --> 00:20:21,428
‪-I would tell her.
‪-Tell her.

452
00:20:21,511 --> 00:20:23,096
‪It's okay. I would tell her.

453
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:26,683
‪I felt so guilty. I gave her ten of those.

454
00:20:26,767 --> 00:20:30,979
‪What if she and Kyung-ho fall out
‪because of what I did? I was worried.

455
00:20:31,063 --> 00:20:33,190
‪I have to fix it. What do I do?

456
00:20:33,273 --> 00:20:34,942
‪I was panicking.

457
00:20:35,025 --> 00:20:37,819
‪I think you're Kyung-ho's first choice.

458
00:20:37,903 --> 00:20:38,779
‪-Yeah.
‪-But

459
00:20:38,862 --> 00:20:41,114
‪that's a separate matter.

460
00:20:41,198 --> 00:20:43,909
‪-You think he gave you the black hearts?
‪-Yeah.

461
00:20:43,992 --> 00:20:44,952
‪-No.
‪-No.

462
00:20:45,035 --> 00:20:46,453
‪But today, I was…

463
00:20:46,536 --> 00:20:47,621
‪-No.
‪-He really didn't.

464
00:20:47,704 --> 00:20:48,664
‪-For real?
‪-For real.

465
00:20:48,747 --> 00:20:50,791
‪-Why do you think that?
‪-The black hearts…

466
00:20:50,874 --> 00:20:52,709
‪I didn't use any of the black hearts.

467
00:20:52,793 --> 00:20:55,629
‪Is that possible? I don't know.

468
00:20:55,712 --> 00:20:59,424
‪-But I definitely don't think he did…
‪-Why?

469
00:20:59,508 --> 00:21:01,635
‪Why do you think that?

470
00:21:01,718 --> 00:21:03,595
‪-I don't think he'd do that.
‪-Yeah.

471
00:21:03,679 --> 00:21:06,223
‪How many black hearts did you get?

472
00:21:06,306 --> 00:21:07,641
‪It was so many I gave up counting.

473
00:21:07,724 --> 00:21:09,226
‪-What?
‪-Really?

474
00:21:09,309 --> 00:21:11,103
‪Was it a few dozen?

475
00:21:11,186 --> 00:21:12,020
‪It was over 15.

476
00:21:12,104 --> 00:21:13,981
‪-Over 15?
‪-I stopped counting after 15.

477
00:21:14,606 --> 00:21:15,732
‪Why were there so many?

478
00:21:15,816 --> 00:21:17,484
<i>‪She said she got over ten.</i>

479
00:21:17,567 --> 00:21:20,153
‪I was relieved, but at the same time,

480
00:21:20,237 --> 00:21:21,321
‪I wondered who gave her those.

481
00:21:21,947 --> 00:21:24,700
‪The emptier the jar gets,

482
00:21:24,783 --> 00:21:27,119
‪the easier it is to tell
‪how many hearts that person used.

483
00:21:27,202 --> 00:21:28,287
‪I didn't see that.

484
00:21:28,370 --> 00:21:31,373
‪-I didn't see that.
‪-I saw it while grabbing mine.

485
00:21:31,957 --> 00:21:34,918
<i>‪But it was clear that he used up a lot.</i>

486
00:21:35,002 --> 00:21:38,338
‪I think he exchanged all those hearts
‪with black hearts and gave them to me.

487
00:21:38,422 --> 00:21:40,382
‪That would be a real shock.

488
00:21:40,465 --> 00:21:42,759
‪-I wanted to be king,
‪-Yeah?

489
00:21:42,843 --> 00:21:48,515
‪so I exchanged about 70 Heart Chips
‪for the black ones

490
00:21:48,598 --> 00:21:51,727
‪and gave everyone
‪ten black chips except for me.

491
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:54,563
‪That's why I had black chips.
‪I wondered who they were from.

492
00:21:54,646 --> 00:21:57,941
‪I was trying to increase
‪my chances of becoming the king.

493
00:21:58,025 --> 00:22:00,319
‪I went that far today,

494
00:22:00,402 --> 00:22:02,988
‪but it still didn't work out,
‪so I got a headache.

495
00:22:03,071 --> 00:22:07,868
‪But now that I've talked to her,
‪my head feels a lot lighter now.

496
00:22:07,951 --> 00:22:13,248
‪I hope you aren't too deflated
‪over Kyung-ho,

497
00:22:13,332 --> 00:22:17,294
‪because to me it seems like he makes
‪his feelings for you very clear.

498
00:22:17,377 --> 00:22:19,338
‪Well, he does,

499
00:22:19,421 --> 00:22:21,423
‪but it feels like he's leaving me hanging

500
00:22:21,506 --> 00:22:23,759
‪when he wants to get to know someone else.

501
00:22:23,842 --> 00:22:26,053
‪-Like, keeping me as an option.
‪-That's how you feel?

502
00:22:26,136 --> 00:22:29,723
‪That's how I feel about
‪why he gave me those hearts.

503
00:22:29,806 --> 00:22:34,186
‪And when he calls my name
‪after having fun with Ga-yeon,

504
00:22:34,269 --> 00:22:39,191
‪it feels like he's being
‪a dog in the manger.

505
00:22:39,274 --> 00:22:41,276
‪-No.
‪-That was infuriating.

506
00:22:42,527 --> 00:22:44,071
‪Your feelings for him are so strong

507
00:22:44,154 --> 00:22:46,782
‪-that you may be reading into things.
‪-Right.

508
00:22:48,033 --> 00:22:48,950
‪You're still a baby.

509
00:22:49,618 --> 00:22:50,911
‪Don't read into things.

510
00:22:50,994 --> 00:22:54,664
‪The important thing is
‪that you are his first choice.

511
00:22:54,748 --> 00:22:57,542
‪But it would hurt me more
‪if that turned out to be false.

512
00:22:58,043 --> 00:23:02,047
‪I don't think I would act like him
‪unless I'm sure of the other person.

513
00:23:02,130 --> 00:23:04,800
‪But I might be feeling this way because
‪I have such strong feelings for him.

514
00:23:04,883 --> 00:23:07,886
‪It might not be a big deal,
‪but I might just be overthinking it.

515
00:23:08,386 --> 00:23:11,932
‪What if Ga-yeon and Kyung-ho go on a date?

516
00:23:12,015 --> 00:23:12,933
‪If they go on a date?

517
00:23:13,809 --> 00:23:15,936
‪Be happy, you two.

518
00:23:16,019 --> 00:23:17,145
‪"Be happy, you two."

519
00:23:17,938 --> 00:23:19,648
‪Do you think you'll lose feelings for him?

520
00:23:20,565 --> 00:23:23,985
‪Since I know how he was with me,

521
00:23:24,069 --> 00:23:26,404
‪I can expect how he'll be
‪with someone else too.

522
00:23:27,447 --> 00:23:29,366
‪I don't think I'd like that.

523
00:23:29,449 --> 00:23:33,620
‪You know, given how she acts, I thought
‪Ga-yeon's first choice might be Kyung-ho.

524
00:23:33,703 --> 00:23:34,830
‪I think

525
00:23:34,913 --> 00:23:37,874
‪-there's only a tiny difference.
‪-I agree.

526
00:23:37,958 --> 00:23:40,001
‪We got to talk about things like this
‪and share how we really felt.

527
00:23:40,085 --> 00:23:40,961
‪Yeah.

528
00:23:41,044 --> 00:23:42,254
‪Oh my. Sorry.

529
00:23:43,046 --> 00:23:44,506
‪Are you done now?

530
00:23:44,589 --> 00:23:45,966
‪-Yeah, we're done.
‪-Really?

531
00:23:46,049 --> 00:23:48,260
‪-Good night.
‪-Yeah.

532
00:23:48,343 --> 00:23:49,678
‪-Good night.
‪-You two are too close.

533
00:23:52,889 --> 00:23:54,808
‪It's warmer than I thought.

534
00:23:55,308 --> 00:23:56,810
‪What was your first impression of me?

535
00:23:56,893 --> 00:23:59,563
‪-You stood out the most.
‪-Really?

536
00:23:59,646 --> 00:24:03,150
‪-You have well-defined features.
‪-My features?

537
00:24:03,233 --> 00:24:05,735
‪So I thought, "Wow."

538
00:24:05,819 --> 00:24:09,030
‪I was so awkward and shy yesterday.

539
00:24:09,114 --> 00:24:10,323
‪-Yeah?
‪-I felt kind of…

540
00:24:10,407 --> 00:24:12,325
‪I think you talked
‪a lot yesterday, though.

541
00:24:12,409 --> 00:24:14,369
‪Really? So am I too talkative today?

542
00:24:17,330 --> 00:24:19,958
‪That's why I became
‪more interested in you.

543
00:24:20,041 --> 00:24:22,043
‪I like someone who talks a lot.

544
00:24:23,503 --> 00:24:26,047
‪-Wow, I'm getting too comfortable here.
‪-Right?

545
00:24:26,131 --> 00:24:28,049
‪-What time is it?
‪-It's 4:11 a.m.

546
00:24:29,301 --> 00:24:30,510
‪No way.

547
00:24:31,428 --> 00:24:33,805
‪You kept getting called away.

548
00:24:33,889 --> 00:24:36,099
‪-No, I wasn't.
‪-Yes, you were.

549
00:24:36,183 --> 00:24:37,809
‪You got called away and didn't come back.

550
00:24:37,893 --> 00:24:40,061
‪I just wandered about here.

551
00:24:40,145 --> 00:24:41,062
‪What should we do?

552
00:24:41,146 --> 00:24:43,106
‪-Let's wash up.
‪-Shall we?

553
00:24:43,190 --> 00:24:45,025
‪-It's too late.
‪-Let's get some sleep.

554
00:24:45,108 --> 00:24:46,610
‪-What?
‪-You're really tall.

555
00:24:47,235 --> 00:24:48,111
‪You're tall.

556
00:24:50,113 --> 00:24:51,156
‪Are you here to do something?

557
00:24:51,239 --> 00:24:54,201
‪-We came to wash up.
‪-You came to wash up?

558
00:24:54,284 --> 00:24:56,119
‪-Wash up then.
‪-Why are you still up?

559
00:24:56,203 --> 00:24:58,788
‪Well, I had a chat.

560
00:24:58,872 --> 00:25:00,582
‪-With whom?
‪-I couldn't sleep.

561
00:25:00,665 --> 00:25:02,250
‪-With whom?
‪-What?

562
00:25:02,334 --> 00:25:03,877
‪With Hye-won.

563
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:05,212
‪Oh, Hye-won.

564
00:25:06,254 --> 00:25:07,505
‪A serious conversation.

565
00:25:07,589 --> 00:25:09,341
‪-A serious conversation?
‪-She's the king.

566
00:25:09,424 --> 00:25:10,550
‪Yeah, be on her good side.

567
00:25:10,634 --> 00:25:12,427
‪Do you think I'm on her good side?

568
00:25:13,929 --> 00:25:15,805
‪Well, you were a tyrant yesterday.

569
00:25:15,889 --> 00:25:17,224
‪What?

570
00:25:17,307 --> 00:25:18,683
‪What are you talking about?

571
00:25:18,767 --> 00:25:20,477
‪You were a tyrant.

572
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:21,978
‪In what way?

573
00:25:22,062 --> 00:25:23,855
‪Because I didn't let you guys go out?

574
00:25:23,939 --> 00:25:25,607
‪No, I'm just kidding.

575
00:25:25,690 --> 00:25:26,566
‪I know.

576
00:25:26,650 --> 00:25:27,901
‪-You know?
‪-Yeah.

577
00:25:27,984 --> 00:25:30,987
‪Why do you keep switching between
‪speaking casually and speaking formally?

578
00:25:31,071 --> 00:25:31,905
‪Sorry.

579
00:25:33,823 --> 00:25:34,950
‪I won't do it.

580
00:25:36,660 --> 00:25:37,661
‪Are you going to wash up?

581
00:25:38,662 --> 00:25:41,331
‪-Can I go to bed like this?
‪-I don't think so.

582
00:25:41,414 --> 00:25:43,708
‪-I don't know.
‪-What should I wear to bed?

583
00:25:45,377 --> 00:25:46,503
‪Want to borrow my zip-up hoodie?

584
00:25:47,087 --> 00:25:48,421
‪I'd love that.

585
00:26:06,356 --> 00:26:07,565
‪Put this on.

586
00:26:07,649 --> 00:26:08,608
‪Thank you.

587
00:26:09,317 --> 00:26:10,443
‪It's nice and thick.

588
00:26:10,527 --> 00:26:12,237
‪That's perfect. Thanks.

589
00:26:13,822 --> 00:26:14,906
‪-Wash up.
‪-Good night.

590
00:26:20,370 --> 00:26:21,454
‪Knock, knock.

591
00:26:23,415 --> 00:26:24,624
‪-Did you wash up?
‪-Yeah.

592
00:26:26,835 --> 00:26:29,462
‪Here's some red ginseng
‪and de-puffing candy.

593
00:26:29,546 --> 00:26:30,964
‪For real? Thank you.

594
00:26:31,047 --> 00:26:35,218
‪Since you're sleeping outside,
‪take that before you go to bed.

595
00:26:35,302 --> 00:26:37,804
‪And take this in the morning.
‪You can take that one now

596
00:26:37,887 --> 00:26:38,847
‪or take them together.

597
00:26:42,058 --> 00:26:45,937
‪When I spoke with Do-geon,

598
00:26:46,021 --> 00:26:49,149
‪he said Chae-rin is his first choice,

599
00:26:49,232 --> 00:26:51,943
‪so you don't have to worry.

600
00:26:52,027 --> 00:26:55,071
‪I don't think Chae-rin was worried at all.

601
00:26:55,155 --> 00:26:56,573
‪Yeah, I could tell.

602
00:26:57,365 --> 00:26:58,992
‪These two are steady.

603
00:26:59,075 --> 00:27:01,286
‪How do you feel, Ye-rim?

604
00:27:01,369 --> 00:27:06,416
‪I would like you and Kyung-ho
‪to have a conversation.

605
00:27:06,499 --> 00:27:08,001
‪-Me?
‪-Yeah.

606
00:27:08,084 --> 00:27:11,254
‪Is there anyone else
‪you'd like to get to know, Ye-rim?

607
00:27:11,338 --> 00:27:14,716
‪There's no one
‪I really want to get to know,

608
00:27:14,799 --> 00:27:18,970
‪but I'm not determined to make things work
‪with my first choice either.

609
00:27:20,055 --> 00:27:21,097
‪Me too.

610
00:27:21,181 --> 00:27:24,726
‪Because of his job and age,
‪I was really conflicted,

611
00:27:24,809 --> 00:27:26,144
‪-to be honest.
‪-You were?

612
00:27:26,227 --> 00:27:27,062
‪Why?

613
00:27:27,145 --> 00:27:29,439
‪He only has qualities I'm not really into.

614
00:27:29,522 --> 00:27:31,816
‪-Really?
‪-He's younger and he is in the arts.

615
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:32,817
‪-Acting, at that.
‪-Gosh.

616
00:27:33,318 --> 00:27:35,779
‪I thought it wouldn't matter,
‪but I was a bit…

617
00:27:35,862 --> 00:27:37,572
‪Really?

618
00:27:37,655 --> 00:27:39,074
‪I was a bit disappointed.

619
00:27:39,157 --> 00:27:43,119
‪If he is a good person despite all that,

620
00:27:44,204 --> 00:27:46,039
‪I'd go ahead with it,

621
00:27:46,122 --> 00:27:49,250
‪but I would have to find that out
‪for the rest of my time here.

622
00:27:49,334 --> 00:27:51,086
‪You should try

623
00:27:51,169 --> 00:27:53,171
‪and talk with others too,

624
00:27:53,254 --> 00:27:54,964
‪if you get a chance.

625
00:27:55,757 --> 00:27:56,716
‪Yeah.

626
00:27:57,217 --> 00:27:59,761
‪His job and age
‪weren't what I expected,

627
00:27:59,844 --> 00:28:01,262
‪but that doesn't mean
‪I want to close that door.

628
00:28:01,346 --> 00:28:03,473
‪I decided to be
‪more level-headed about him.

629
00:28:03,556 --> 00:28:06,768
‪If I like him despite his job and age,

630
00:28:07,435 --> 00:28:08,812
‪that'd mean he's a really good person.

631
00:28:10,063 --> 00:28:11,356
‪Are you cleaning up by yourself?

632
00:28:11,439 --> 00:28:13,983
‪Yeah, I just wanted to tidy up.

633
00:28:14,484 --> 00:28:15,610
‪Isn't it cold out there?

634
00:28:16,277 --> 00:28:17,404
‪It's warmer than I thought.

635
00:28:17,487 --> 00:28:19,489
‪If I had known it'd be warm,
‪I would have picked you.

636
00:28:21,116 --> 00:28:22,033
‪Why didn't you pick me?

637
00:28:22,117 --> 00:28:24,411
‪I thought no one wanted to go.

638
00:28:26,621 --> 00:28:28,748
‪Hey, you're pretty good at that.

639
00:28:28,832 --> 00:28:30,208
‪No joke, right?

640
00:28:30,291 --> 00:28:31,376
‪Yeah, no joke.

641
00:28:32,210 --> 00:28:33,753
‪What time do you want to get dolled up?

642
00:28:33,837 --> 00:28:35,380
‪I'm going to open up tomorrow.

643
00:28:35,463 --> 00:28:36,423
‪What time should I come?

644
00:28:36,506 --> 00:28:37,465
‪About 10 a.m.?

645
00:28:38,133 --> 00:28:39,926
‪Okay, got it.

646
00:28:40,009 --> 00:28:40,844
‪Sleep well.

647
00:28:41,845 --> 00:28:43,596
‪-Good night.
‪-Good night.

648
00:28:46,141 --> 00:28:47,851
<i>‪What do you think will happen from now on?</i>

649
00:28:48,476 --> 00:28:50,019
<i>‪What are you going to do?</i>

650
00:28:50,103 --> 00:28:51,396
‪I'll just follow my heart.

651
00:28:52,147 --> 00:28:56,109
‪I think everybody is going to
‪want to come here now.

652
00:28:56,735 --> 00:28:57,694
‪-Here?
‪-Yeah.

653
00:28:57,777 --> 00:28:59,154
‪-With someone they like?
‪-Yeah.

654
00:28:59,946 --> 00:29:02,574
‪What's going on? I sense some spark here.

655
00:29:03,283 --> 00:29:04,242
‪-Here?
‪-Yeah.

656
00:29:04,325 --> 00:29:05,827
‪-With someone they like?
‪-Yeah.

657
00:29:06,536 --> 00:29:10,206
‪Then it would be amazing

658
00:29:10,290 --> 00:29:11,624
‪to come here on the last night.

659
00:29:11,708 --> 00:29:14,753
‪I know. It seems like a punishment but…

660
00:29:14,836 --> 00:29:16,796
‪-Yeah, but it's also an opportunity.
‪-Yeah.

661
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:18,381
‪It can be an opportunity.

662
00:29:18,465 --> 00:29:22,552
‪It can be a chance
‪for the relationship to deepen.

663
00:29:23,303 --> 00:29:25,472
‪Would you like to come back again
‪with Chae-rin?

664
00:29:25,555 --> 00:29:26,765
‪Yeah, if I can…

665
00:29:28,141 --> 00:29:29,851
‪I don't want to come back here.

666
00:29:34,481 --> 00:29:35,398
<i>‪Good night.</i>

667
00:29:49,454 --> 00:29:51,372
‪GA-YEON WAKES UP
‪7:40 A.M.

668
00:29:56,044 --> 00:29:57,712
‪Do-geon, are you asleep?

669
00:29:59,005 --> 00:29:59,839
‪Are you?

670
00:30:01,216 --> 00:30:02,884
‪It's 7:40 a.m.

671
00:30:06,137 --> 00:30:07,222
‪Shall we go inside?

672
00:30:12,894 --> 00:30:14,437
‪-Bye.
‪-Bye.

673
00:30:14,521 --> 00:30:16,773
‪THEY ARE GOING TO GET SOME MORE SLEEP

674
00:30:17,357 --> 00:30:18,775
‪How was it? Did you sleep well?

675
00:30:18,858 --> 00:30:22,111
‪Do-geon and I were so tired,
‪so we went straight to sleep.

676
00:30:22,195 --> 00:30:24,989
‪I couldn't fall asleep, but he did.

677
00:30:25,073 --> 00:30:26,324
‪No way.

678
00:30:26,407 --> 00:30:29,327
‪There was nothing romantic about it.

679
00:30:29,410 --> 00:30:30,995
‪Then,

680
00:30:32,163 --> 00:30:33,039
‪you don't recommend it?

681
00:30:33,122 --> 00:30:35,750
‪It would be nice
‪if you and Do-geon went there.

682
00:30:35,834 --> 00:30:39,170
‪If you go with someone you like,

683
00:30:39,254 --> 00:30:40,380
‪you'd want to hold hands.

684
00:30:40,463 --> 00:30:42,549
‪-For real?
‪-Yeah.

685
00:30:42,632 --> 00:30:44,133
‪I think

686
00:30:44,217 --> 00:30:47,971
‪it'll be a huge advantage
‪if you go on the third or fourth night.

687
00:30:52,016 --> 00:30:54,978
‪-What kind of place is it?
‪-I don't know.

688
00:30:55,979 --> 00:30:57,397
‪-Aren't you cold?
‪-What?

689
00:30:57,480 --> 00:30:58,731
‪-Aren't you cold?
‪-No.

690
00:30:58,815 --> 00:30:59,983
‪Are you wearing that today?

