921
00:40:52,783 --> 00:40:55,786
‪Last night, I begged you not to

922
00:40:56,370 --> 00:40:59,748
‪pair me up with Kyung-ho, right?

923
00:40:59,832 --> 00:41:02,001
‪But today,

924
00:41:03,669 --> 00:41:05,796
‪I feel differently.

925
00:41:07,006 --> 00:41:09,216
‪It would be nice to go out with Kyung-ho.

926
00:41:09,300 --> 00:41:11,051
‪PREFERRED DATE
‪YE-RIM CHOOSES KYUNG-HO

927
00:41:11,135 --> 00:41:12,386
‪Great. What a relief.

928
00:41:13,095 --> 00:41:14,054
‪But…

929
00:41:15,389 --> 00:41:18,184
‪I'm curious about Do-geon too.

930
00:41:18,267 --> 00:41:19,768
‪-Do-geon?
‪-Yes.

931
00:41:20,269 --> 00:41:22,229
‪-Where do you want to go?
‪-Where do I want to go?

932
00:41:22,313 --> 00:41:24,565
‪The craft studio

933
00:41:25,191 --> 00:41:26,609
‪or digging for shellfish at the mudflat?

934
00:41:26,692 --> 00:41:29,195
‪Really? I think you'd look so cute.

935
00:41:30,112 --> 00:41:32,072
‪Dig some up
‪so we can make <i>‪kalguksu</i>‪ with it.

936
00:41:32,156 --> 00:41:33,616
‪That sounds amazing.

937
00:41:33,699 --> 00:41:36,452
‪-It'll work out for you.
‪-Will it work out for me?

938
00:41:37,453 --> 00:41:38,954
‪Okay. See you.

939
00:41:43,501 --> 00:41:45,753
‪Welcome, my love.

940
00:41:45,836 --> 00:41:47,046
‪It suits you, Hye-won.

941
00:41:47,129 --> 00:41:49,173
‪Does it suit me? Thank you.

942
00:41:49,256 --> 00:41:50,299
‪First of all,

943
00:41:50,799 --> 00:41:55,596
‪the person who I definitely have
‪romantic feelings for is Jung-min.

944
00:41:55,679 --> 00:41:57,973
‪But I had

945
00:41:58,641 --> 00:42:02,478
‪-a chat with Kyung-ho yesterday.
‪-Okay.

946
00:42:02,561 --> 00:42:03,812
‪He really

947
00:42:04,688 --> 00:42:06,357
‪opened up to me about how he felt.

948
00:42:06,899 --> 00:42:09,109
‪So I told him honestly

949
00:42:09,193 --> 00:42:12,571
‪that I'm not sure what I feel for him

950
00:42:12,655 --> 00:42:15,866
‪is romantic or not.

951
00:42:22,665 --> 00:42:24,166
‪What is a romantic feeling?

952
00:42:25,876 --> 00:42:27,378
‪What is a romantic feeling?

953
00:42:27,461 --> 00:42:29,547
‪Tell me the exact definition of it,
‪Ga-yeon.

954
00:42:29,630 --> 00:42:32,341
‪I don't know how many times
‪I've heard "romantic feelings" today.

955
00:42:32,424 --> 00:42:34,301
‪-Ga-yeon, please tell me.
‪-Look.

956
00:42:34,385 --> 00:42:35,553
‪-Hey.
‪-You're driving me crazy.

957
00:42:35,636 --> 00:42:36,971
‪-It's too soon to get angry.
‪-For real?

958
00:42:37,054 --> 00:42:39,598
‪She hasn't even mentioned
‪how she keeps looking at him yet.

959
00:42:39,682 --> 00:42:41,392
‪She hasn't brought up
‪how she gazes at him yet.

960
00:42:41,475 --> 00:42:44,603
‪…is romantic or not.

961
00:42:48,524 --> 00:42:50,067
‪But I keep finding myself gazing at him.

962
00:42:54,780 --> 00:42:56,991
‪But I keep finding myself gazing at him.

963
00:42:57,575 --> 00:42:58,867
‪I understand.

964
00:42:58,951 --> 00:43:00,494
‪I leave my fate in your hands.

965
00:43:00,578 --> 00:43:01,620
‪All right.

966
00:43:01,704 --> 00:43:02,621
‪PREFERRED DATE
‪GA-YEON CHOOSES KYUNG-HO

967
00:43:02,705 --> 00:43:04,832
‪-Thank you.
‪-Thank you.

968
00:43:08,961 --> 00:43:09,795
‪Hello.

969
00:43:09,878 --> 00:43:11,839
‪-Hello, Your Majesty.
‪-Hello.

970
00:43:12,923 --> 00:43:15,301
‪As I said yesterday,

971
00:43:16,093 --> 00:43:18,596
‪I'd like to go on a date with you.

972
00:43:20,889 --> 00:43:23,767
‪Since yesterday,
‪I've been feeling sure about it.

973
00:43:24,977 --> 00:43:26,186
‪So that's what I want.

974
00:43:26,270 --> 00:43:27,438
‪PREFERRED DATE
‪HA-YOON CHOOSES HYE-WON

975
00:43:29,148 --> 00:43:29,982
‪Good.

976
00:43:34,862 --> 00:43:35,738
‪What?

977
00:43:36,363 --> 00:43:37,197
‪"Good."

978
00:43:39,533 --> 00:43:41,410
‪Let's hear it one more time.

979
00:43:42,328 --> 00:43:43,412
‪Let's hear "Good" one more time.

980
00:43:45,456 --> 00:43:46,332
‪Good.

981
00:43:49,627 --> 00:43:53,047
‪The breathy voice. They'd love it at JYP.

982
00:43:53,631 --> 00:43:55,716
‪-My ears are being tickled.
‪-It's tingling.

983
00:43:55,799 --> 00:43:57,301
‪-Can we hear it one more time?
‪-Jeez.

984
00:43:58,927 --> 00:43:59,762
‪Good.

985
00:44:02,348 --> 00:44:04,016
‪-Where do you want to go?
‪-I want to go with you.

986
00:44:04,099 --> 00:44:07,394
‪With the most genuine gaze,

987
00:44:07,478 --> 00:44:09,730
<i>‪Ha-yoon calmly and sincerely said,</i>

988
00:44:09,813 --> 00:44:12,107
<i>‪"I want to go on a date with you."</i>

989
00:44:12,191 --> 00:44:15,069
<i>‪He came across as so reliable</i>
<i>‪and not pushy at all.</i>

990
00:44:15,152 --> 00:44:18,322
‪I was really touched.

991
00:44:18,405 --> 00:44:20,949
‪Do you like risotto and stuff like that?

992
00:44:21,033 --> 00:44:23,535
‪-The king does not like things like that.
‪-Then,

993
00:44:23,619 --> 00:44:24,745
‪what about foot bath and barbecue?

994
00:44:24,828 --> 00:44:25,704
‪Foot bath and barbecue?

995
00:44:25,788 --> 00:44:27,331
‪-One of these two.
‪-First and second choice?

996
00:44:27,414 --> 00:44:29,458
‪The king will take it into consideration

997
00:44:29,541 --> 00:44:32,211
‪and she will consider
‪whether she wants to go with you too.

998
00:44:32,294 --> 00:44:34,046
‪-Of course.
‪-Then, I'll let you know.

999
00:44:34,129 --> 00:44:35,005
‪-Yes.
‪-Okay.

1000
00:44:35,089 --> 00:44:37,466
‪-I trust you'll make a wise decision.
‪-Of course.

1001
00:44:37,549 --> 00:44:38,550
‪-All right.
‪-All right.

1002
00:44:38,634 --> 00:44:40,469
‪-I'll remember that. Goodbye.
‪-Bye.

1003
00:44:42,262 --> 00:44:44,139
‪THE LAST PETITIONER LEAVES

1004
00:44:52,022 --> 00:44:54,608
<i>‪I think I made the right choice.</i>

1005
00:44:54,691 --> 00:44:57,694
‪INSTRUCTIONS FOR KING OF HEARTS
‪THE POWER TO DECIDE THE DATES

1006
00:44:57,778 --> 00:45:01,365
‪THE KING FINISHED MAKING ALL THE DECISIONS

1007
00:45:01,448 --> 00:45:03,283
‪You see, it seems like--

1008
00:45:03,367 --> 00:45:06,245
‪-Your Majesty!
‪-It was so difficult.

1009
00:45:06,328 --> 00:45:07,621
‪-Well done.
‪-Come and sit.

1010
00:45:07,704 --> 00:45:09,039
‪It was really…

1011
00:45:09,123 --> 00:45:10,582
‪That's the weight of being the king.

1012
00:45:10,666 --> 00:45:12,751
‪-Okay.
‪-There was nothing I could do.

1013
00:45:12,835 --> 00:45:14,503
‪-I'm sorry.
‪-Sorry about what?

1014
00:45:14,586 --> 00:45:16,922
‪-I can't look at anybody.
‪-It's okay.

1015
00:45:18,507 --> 00:45:19,800
‪I wonder what the decisions are.

1016
00:45:22,219 --> 00:45:24,012
‪-I'm nervous.
‪-Go get it.

1017
00:45:24,096 --> 00:45:24,930
‪POLITE BOW

1018
00:45:26,223 --> 00:45:27,391
‪So he knew how to be polite?

1019
00:45:27,474 --> 00:45:29,268
‪You can tell he was a royal.

1020
00:45:31,728 --> 00:45:33,313
‪Read it for us.

1021
00:45:33,397 --> 00:45:37,151
‪"As per the decision
‪of the second king, Jung Hye-won…"

1022
00:45:37,234 --> 00:45:38,485
‪Pay attention.

1023
00:45:38,569 --> 00:45:41,280
‪"…you have been paired up as follows."

1024
00:45:42,030 --> 00:45:44,741
‪I'll mix them and give them out randomly,
‪so please read them out loud.

1025
00:45:44,825 --> 00:45:46,785
‪THE DATE PAIRING CARDS ARE GIVEN RANDOMLY

1026
00:45:48,745 --> 00:45:50,289
‪Foot bath and barbecue.

1027
00:45:50,372 --> 00:45:51,248
‪Who's going?

1028
00:45:51,832 --> 00:45:52,708
‪Ye-rim

1029
00:45:53,959 --> 00:45:54,793
‪and Do-geon.

1030
00:45:56,378 --> 00:45:57,963
<i>‪In the morning,</i>

1031
00:45:58,046 --> 00:46:01,758
‪I playfully asked Do-geon
‪what it'd be like if we went on a date.

1032
00:46:01,842 --> 00:46:03,594
<i>‪And he requested for me.</i>

1033
00:46:03,677 --> 00:46:05,762
‪So I was a bit surprised.

1034
00:46:06,346 --> 00:46:07,890
‪He actually requested
‪to go on a date with me?

1035
00:46:07,973 --> 00:46:09,308
‪Oh my. I'm getting butterflies.

1036
00:46:11,727 --> 00:46:12,686
‪We've only seen Do-geon

1037
00:46:12,769 --> 00:46:13,854
‪-as the younger guy.
‪-Yeah.

1038
00:46:13,937 --> 00:46:15,230
‪We'll see what he's like

1039
00:46:15,314 --> 00:46:17,441
‪-to a younger woman.
‪-Exactly.

1040
00:46:18,484 --> 00:46:20,068
‪I told you today, didn't I?

1041
00:46:20,152 --> 00:46:22,446
‪-Yeah. Nice.
‪-I said we'd go out.

1042
00:46:22,529 --> 00:46:24,907
<i>‪I really didn't want</i>
<i>‪Do-geon and Ye-rim to be paired.</i>

1043
00:46:25,449 --> 00:46:29,495
‪I secretly hoped that
‪Do-geon and Ye-rim wouldn't be paired.

1044
00:46:29,578 --> 00:46:32,247
‪After this date,

1045
00:46:32,331 --> 00:46:35,417
‪our first choices might change.

1046
00:46:38,754 --> 00:46:41,590
‪"Cafe and grilled shellfish."

1047
00:46:41,673 --> 00:46:43,050
‪How romantic.

1048
00:46:45,260 --> 00:46:46,386
‪"Ga-yeon…

1049
00:46:49,640 --> 00:46:50,516
‪and Kyung-ho."

1050
00:46:53,727 --> 00:46:54,645
‪Yeah.

1051
00:46:54,728 --> 00:46:57,064
‪And Jung-min ended up announcing that.

1052
00:46:59,316 --> 00:47:01,276
‪-What is this?
‪-How could you?

1053
00:47:01,360 --> 00:47:02,194
‪I'm so sorry.

1054
00:47:02,277 --> 00:47:03,779
‪What a cruel king.

1055
00:47:05,405 --> 00:47:07,741
‪You need some time apart.

1056
00:47:07,824 --> 00:47:09,034
‪-Yeah.
‪-Right?

1057
00:47:09,117 --> 00:47:10,994
<i>‪She basically betrayed me.</i>

1058
00:47:11,828 --> 00:47:16,124
‪We're the ones who made Hye-won king.

1059
00:47:16,708 --> 00:47:19,211
<i>‪I guess, Ga-yeon's second choice</i>

1060
00:47:19,294 --> 00:47:20,504
<i>‪was Kyung-ho.</i>

1061
00:47:20,587 --> 00:47:22,422
‪But the kind king

1062
00:47:22,506 --> 00:47:25,842
‪didn't know Ga-yeon's second choice,
‪so I think she just paired them.

1063
00:47:25,926 --> 00:47:29,805
<i>‪They were paired at uncanny timing,</i>
<i>‪so I got a bit nervous.</i>

1064
00:47:29,888 --> 00:47:31,139
‪Honestly, I was happy.

1065
00:47:31,223 --> 00:47:32,808
‪I had this heaviness right here.

1066
00:47:32,891 --> 00:47:35,894
<i>‪I felt like a weight</i>
<i>‪had been lifted off my chest.</i>

1067
00:47:36,895 --> 00:47:40,065
<i>‪I thought, "Hey, what's going on?"</i>

1068
00:47:40,148 --> 00:47:44,903
‪Until last night, Ga-yeon named Jung-min
‪as her definite first choice,

1069
00:47:44,987 --> 00:47:47,447
‪so I thought she'd go out with Jung-min.

1070
00:47:56,206 --> 00:47:58,083
<i>‪I knew I'd be going out with Kyung-ho.</i>

1071
00:47:59,626 --> 00:48:01,336
‪-What?
‪-What? She knew?

1072
00:48:01,420 --> 00:48:02,588
‪-Let's see.
‪-I'm scared.

1073
00:48:02,671 --> 00:48:05,048
‪-Let's see what happened.
‪-I'm scared, Joo-heon!

1074
00:48:06,508 --> 00:48:09,469
‪LAST NIGHT

1075
00:48:09,553 --> 00:48:11,805
‪Come over here.

1076
00:48:11,888 --> 00:48:14,433
‪-Who do you want to go out with?
‪-What?

1077
00:48:14,516 --> 00:48:15,517
‪The date?

1078
00:48:18,145 --> 00:48:19,104
‪Gosh.

1079
00:48:19,605 --> 00:48:20,439
‪What about you?

1080
00:48:21,398 --> 00:48:22,274
‪What about you?

1081
00:48:22,357 --> 00:48:23,191
‪Me?

1082
00:48:23,275 --> 00:48:25,986
‪The person I find fun

1083
00:48:26,069 --> 00:48:29,615
‪and my eyes are drawn to is Kyung-ho.

1084
00:48:29,698 --> 00:48:31,908
‪You want to check for yourself, right?

1085
00:48:31,992 --> 00:48:34,077
<i>‪Originally, we had agreed that</i>

1086
00:48:34,161 --> 00:48:38,081
‪Jung-min and I would go out
‪and Ha-yoon and Hye-won would go out.

1087
00:48:38,165 --> 00:48:40,584
‪We had a secret chat of sorts.

1088
00:48:40,667 --> 00:48:42,753
‪If I go out with Jung-min tomorrow…

1089
00:48:43,462 --> 00:48:44,880
‪I don't know.

1090
00:48:44,963 --> 00:48:45,922
‪I know.

1091
00:48:46,757 --> 00:48:48,425
‪I'm going to follow your decision.

1092
00:48:48,508 --> 00:48:50,844
‪I'm glad I became king.

1093
00:48:50,927 --> 00:48:52,888
‪You shook everything up.

1094
00:48:53,930 --> 00:48:55,140
‪I gave her my opinion.

1095
00:48:55,223 --> 00:48:58,101
‪"Instead of this combination,
‪these two might be good too."

1096
00:48:58,185 --> 00:48:59,811
<i>‪"I hope it can go this way."</i>

1097
00:48:59,895 --> 00:49:02,481
<i>‪And Hye-won was in agreement with me.</i>

1098
00:49:02,564 --> 00:49:05,817
‪Those two seem so good together,
‪in my opinion.

1099
00:49:05,901 --> 00:49:08,028
‪I had to see them together.

1100
00:49:08,111 --> 00:49:11,281
‪And Ga-yeon played a role
‪in my decision too.

1101
00:49:11,365 --> 00:49:14,701
‪I think Ga-yeon wanted to
‪go on a date with Kyung-ho more.

1102
00:49:14,785 --> 00:49:19,414
‪I think that Kyung-ho and I
‪look good together, appearance-wise.

1103
00:49:19,498 --> 00:49:21,333
‪That's why I thought of us
‪getting paired up.

1104
00:49:21,416 --> 00:49:24,336
‪Do-geon and Ye-rim are
‪around the same age, right?

1105
00:49:24,419 --> 00:49:26,338
‪We decided to shake everything up.

1106
00:49:26,421 --> 00:49:30,217
‪I knew it wasn't the deal
‪our alliance agreed on,

1107
00:49:30,300 --> 00:49:32,344
‪but I wanted to pair Ga-yeon and Kyung-ho.

1108
00:49:32,427 --> 00:49:36,056
‪She did as I expected.

1109
00:49:37,015 --> 00:49:39,810
<i>‪So I wasn't really troubled.</i>

1110
00:49:43,021 --> 00:49:46,066
‪It may seem like Hye-won is the tyrant,

1111
00:49:46,149 --> 00:49:48,068
‪-but there was a mastermind behind her.
‪-Right.

1112
00:49:48,151 --> 00:49:49,069
‪You're right.

1113
00:49:49,152 --> 00:49:50,946
‪There was a queen dowager
‪behind the queen.

1114
00:49:51,029 --> 00:49:52,197
‪That's an accurate analogy.

1115
00:49:55,617 --> 00:49:58,829
‪"Dig for shellfish at the mudflat and eat
‪Korean Chinese food. A 30,000 won date."

1116
00:50:03,750 --> 00:50:05,293
‪"Jung-min and Chae-rin."

1117
00:50:09,131 --> 00:50:11,133
‪Wait. What?

1118
00:50:11,216 --> 00:50:12,342
‪-What?
‪-Why?

1119
00:50:12,426 --> 00:50:14,720
‪-This is so surprising.
‪-Why?

1120
00:50:15,303 --> 00:50:16,430
‪This is going to be fun.

1121
00:50:17,431 --> 00:50:19,433
‪How did she come up with this pairing?

1122
00:50:19,516 --> 00:50:21,226
‪Did she pair
‪the two funny people together?

1123
00:50:21,309 --> 00:50:25,021
‪In 30,000 won, both the mudflat activity
‪and Korean Chinese food are included.

1124
00:50:26,690 --> 00:50:29,234
‪-Goodness.
‪-What about the cost of the activity?

1125
00:50:29,317 --> 00:50:30,485
‪What about the work pants,

1126
00:50:30,569 --> 00:50:32,571
‪-boots, and small garden hoe rentals?
‪-You figure it out.

1127
00:50:32,654 --> 00:50:34,489
‪We should take some salt.

1128
00:50:34,573 --> 00:50:35,741
‪We have to take that.

1129
00:50:35,824 --> 00:50:37,909
‪I bet the shellfish are scared right now.

1130
00:50:38,994 --> 00:50:40,454
‪I'll give the shellfish a call.

1131
00:50:40,537 --> 00:50:41,621
‪Have fun.

1132
00:50:41,705 --> 00:50:43,957
‪They said they're the comedic duo

1133
00:50:44,040 --> 00:50:46,960
‪and everyone was laughing and all,

1134
00:50:47,043 --> 00:50:51,965
‪but I was secretly feeling a bit nervous.

1135
00:50:52,591 --> 00:50:55,427
‪As for the craft studio
‪and Italian restaurant,

1136
00:50:55,510 --> 00:50:58,138
‪-Hye-won and Ha-yoon will be going.
‪-Yes.

1137
00:50:59,139 --> 00:51:00,849
‪-The craft studio.
‪-Because I'm king.

1138
00:51:00,932 --> 00:51:02,476
‪-What will you make?
‪-Sounds fun.

1139
00:51:03,852 --> 00:51:05,270
‪Get some rest at the cafe.

1140
00:51:06,021 --> 00:51:06,855
‪"Get some rest"?

1141
00:51:07,689 --> 00:51:08,815
‪I'll bring some shellfish.

1142
00:51:10,942 --> 00:51:14,321
<i>‪I think things turned out</i>
<i>‪the way we talked last night.</i>

1143
00:51:14,404 --> 00:51:15,947
<i>‪It went exactly that way.</i>

1144
00:51:16,031 --> 00:51:18,074
‪It would be nice to
‪have a chat with everyone.

1145
00:51:18,158 --> 00:51:19,451
‪Yeah, to make it really different.

1146
00:51:19,534 --> 00:51:22,788
‪And you can be attracted
‪to a different person too.

1147
