1607
01:10:16,378 --> 01:10:18,339
‪THEY KEEP HEARING THE HAPPY COUPLE

1608
01:10:18,422 --> 01:10:20,883
‪Doesn't it seem like
‪they're digging up a lot?

1609
01:10:20,966 --> 01:10:23,219
‪They keep screaming.

1610
01:10:23,302 --> 01:10:24,803
‪We're competing with them.

1611
01:10:24,887 --> 01:10:25,846
‪Hurry up and find them.

1612
01:10:25,930 --> 01:10:26,847
‪Here's one.

1613
01:10:27,431 --> 01:10:28,307
‪-Woo!
‪-Woo!

1614
01:10:28,933 --> 01:10:30,059
‪This is embarrassing.

1615
01:10:30,142 --> 01:10:31,227
‪-I know.
‪-Let's not do it.

1616
01:10:37,608 --> 01:10:40,486
‪-Watching those two makes me happy.
‪-Yeah.

1617
01:10:40,569 --> 01:10:43,656
‪-It'd be nice to see a spark between them.
‪-I know.

1618
01:10:43,739 --> 01:10:45,824
‪-Want to make a bet?
‪-What kind of bet?

1619
01:10:45,908 --> 01:10:46,867
‪The amount.

1620
01:10:47,660 --> 01:10:49,620
‪Man, I would've put
‪even the small ones in then.

1621
01:10:50,621 --> 01:10:51,997
‪-Give the other person Heart Chips?
‪-The Heart Chips?

1622
01:10:52,831 --> 01:10:54,166
‪Give me Heart Chips,

1623
01:10:54,250 --> 01:10:55,584
‪this many.

1624
01:10:57,753 --> 01:10:58,921
‪I'm not going home then.

1625
01:11:00,547 --> 01:11:02,716
‪-Go!
‪-Oh, no! My feet!

1626
01:11:02,800 --> 01:11:03,634
‪THE HEART CHIP WAGER IS ON

1627
01:11:04,301 --> 01:11:05,552
‪I should run away.

1628
01:11:05,636 --> 01:11:07,388
‪Don't follow me.

1629
01:11:07,471 --> 01:11:09,431
‪Have you lost your mind?

1630
01:11:09,515 --> 01:11:11,016
‪-I have an ax.
‪-Okay.

1631
01:11:11,600 --> 01:11:12,601
‪You're scary.

1632
01:11:12,685 --> 01:11:14,144
‪SNEAKILY

1633
01:11:14,228 --> 01:11:15,312
‪There are spots with a lot of them.

1634
01:11:15,396 --> 01:11:16,355
‪STEALS

1635
01:11:16,981 --> 01:11:18,274
‪You didn't take any, did you?

1636
01:11:18,357 --> 01:11:19,733
‪Are you insane?

1637
01:11:19,817 --> 01:11:21,443
‪You can't trust anybody.

1638
01:11:21,527 --> 01:11:23,028
‪I found one.

1639
01:11:23,112 --> 01:11:24,321
‪Awesome.

1640
01:11:24,405 --> 01:11:25,948
‪Why aren't there any here?

1641
01:11:26,031 --> 01:11:26,991
‪I can't see any.

1642
01:11:29,785 --> 01:11:30,619
‪Me neither.

1643
01:11:30,703 --> 01:11:33,330
‪Are you saying you can't find any
‪while digging them up?

1644
01:11:34,707 --> 01:11:35,874
‪Don't dig there.

1645
01:11:35,958 --> 01:11:37,543
‪Hey, it's a jackpot here!

1646
01:11:39,086 --> 01:11:40,045
‪There are two here.

1647
01:11:40,713 --> 01:11:41,672
‪No.

1648
01:11:41,755 --> 01:11:42,631
‪Hey, putting them in for now.

1649
01:11:45,467 --> 01:11:46,302
‪Sorry.

1650
01:11:46,385 --> 01:11:48,137
‪-Jeez. Go away.
‪-Come on.

1651
01:11:48,220 --> 01:11:49,305
‪-Wow!
‪-What?

1652
01:11:49,388 --> 01:11:50,264
‪Jackpot.

1653
01:11:55,269 --> 01:11:56,478
‪Are you okay?

1654
01:11:59,648 --> 01:12:00,733
‪It's so big.

1655
01:12:00,816 --> 01:12:01,650
‪Done.

1656
01:12:01,734 --> 01:12:03,944
‪THE SHELLFISH DIGGING CHALLENGE
‪FOR HEART CHIPS IS OVER

1657
01:12:04,028 --> 01:12:05,571
‪-Let's count them.
‪-Okay.

1658
01:12:05,654 --> 01:12:07,823
‪-Let's count each other's basket.
‪-Each other's?

1659
01:12:07,906 --> 01:12:08,741
‪FAIR AND SQUARE

1660
01:12:08,824 --> 01:12:10,701
‪-Discard the broken ones.
‪-I'll start counting.

1661
01:12:10,784 --> 01:12:12,286
‪Three, four.

1662
01:12:12,369 --> 01:12:13,829
‪Forty.

1663
01:12:13,912 --> 01:12:15,122
‪CAREFULLY

1664
01:12:15,205 --> 01:12:16,206
‪Ten… Fifty.

1665
01:12:16,290 --> 01:12:17,833
‪-You've got 56.
‪-It's 55.

1666
01:12:17,916 --> 01:12:18,917
‪You dug up a lot.

1667
01:12:19,585 --> 01:12:20,461
‪Sixty-three.

1668
01:12:21,879 --> 01:12:23,547
‪You're going to give me 63 Heart Chips?

1669
01:12:25,674 --> 01:12:27,051
‪Will you be okay with that?

1670
01:12:27,676 --> 01:12:28,761
‪I mean, that's what we agreed on.

1671
01:12:28,844 --> 01:12:30,679
‪-You have to give them to me.
‪-Okay.

1672
01:12:32,598 --> 01:12:33,766
‪Yes!

1673
01:12:35,976 --> 01:12:37,936
‪-What a shame.
‪-What do you mean?

1674
01:12:38,020 --> 01:12:40,814
‪I was hoping to be king.

1675
01:12:40,898 --> 01:12:42,107
‪It's tough.

1676
01:12:42,691 --> 01:12:44,610
‪Jjajangmyeon<i>‪ is best</i>
<i>‪after a long day's work.</i>

1677
01:12:44,693 --> 01:12:46,779
‪Gosh, it's so cheap.

1678
01:12:46,862 --> 01:12:48,489
‪JJAJANGMYEON, 3,000 WON

1679
01:12:48,572 --> 01:12:49,782
‪What do you want?

1680
01:12:49,865 --> 01:12:52,284
‪-We have no choice.
‪-Right, we don't.

1681
01:12:52,785 --> 01:12:54,078
‪Let's get two of that.

1682
01:12:54,161 --> 01:12:55,037
‪How much do we have left?

1683
01:12:55,120 --> 01:12:56,789
‪We'll have 4,000 won left.

1684
01:12:58,165 --> 01:12:59,416
<i>‪-Erguotou.</i>
<i>‪-Erguotou.</i>

1685
01:12:59,500 --> 01:13:00,584
‪-4,000 won.
‪-4,000 won.

1686
01:13:00,667 --> 01:13:02,961
‪-That'll come to 10,000 won.
‪-Money well spent.

1687
01:13:03,045 --> 01:13:03,879
‪USED UP 30,000 WON

1688
01:13:06,048 --> 01:13:07,132
‪Hey, 56%?

1689
01:13:07,800 --> 01:13:09,843
‪-I'm going to drink.
‪-Me too.

1690
01:13:19,478 --> 01:13:20,479
‪Water.

1691
01:13:21,688 --> 01:13:22,940
‪There's a water dispenser.

1692
01:13:28,070 --> 01:13:29,780
‪-Here. Mix it.
‪-Okay.

1693
01:13:29,863 --> 01:13:32,199
‪I like it. It warms me up.

1694
01:13:32,282 --> 01:13:34,451
‪My tongue is numb.

1695
01:13:34,535 --> 01:13:36,870
‪-You drank it up in one go.
‪-My tongue is numb.

1696
01:13:36,954 --> 01:13:38,372
‪-Enjoy.
‪-Enjoy.

1697
01:13:43,252 --> 01:13:44,962
‪-It's so delicious.
‪-Yeah, it's good.

1698
01:13:45,045 --> 01:13:46,547
‪It's really the old school <i>‪jjajangmyeon</i>‪.

1699
01:13:46,630 --> 01:13:47,548
‪It's really tasty.

1700
01:13:48,340 --> 01:13:49,174
‪Cheers.

1701
01:13:49,800 --> 01:13:51,051
‪Take small sips.

1702
01:13:51,135 --> 01:13:52,636
‪The smell faded.

1703
01:13:53,470 --> 01:13:54,888
‪No, it didn't. Gosh.

1704
01:13:55,806 --> 01:13:56,640
‪I did it.

1705
01:14:02,604 --> 01:14:03,605
‪Man, the smell.

1706
01:14:07,151 --> 01:14:09,069
‪Did you have a second choice?

1707
01:14:09,153 --> 01:14:10,195
‪-Second choice?
‪-Yeah.

1708
01:14:10,279 --> 01:14:11,822
‪-I didn't have one.
‪-Right?

1709
01:14:12,823 --> 01:14:13,782
‪I could tell.

1710
01:14:14,366 --> 01:14:16,368
‪-Ga-yeon is--
‪-But you left a good first impression.

1711
01:14:18,745 --> 01:14:20,205
‪What? Really?

1712
01:14:20,289 --> 01:14:22,040
‪-You were the first one I saw, right?
‪-Yeah.

1713
01:14:22,124 --> 01:14:24,084
‪You see,

1714
01:14:24,835 --> 01:14:28,630
‪the way you talked and reacted
‪wasn't so over-the-top,

1715
01:14:28,714 --> 01:14:29,590
‪like, just enough.

1716
01:14:30,215 --> 01:14:31,049
‪I did think that.

1717
01:14:31,133 --> 01:14:32,593
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

1718
01:14:34,261 --> 01:14:35,304
‪-So?
‪-What?

1719
01:14:35,387 --> 01:14:36,930
‪Why did you go for Ga-yeon, then?

1720
01:14:37,014 --> 01:14:38,432
‪Well, that happened yesterday.

1721
01:14:38,515 --> 01:14:41,894
‪-You chose her on the first day too.
‪-That's right.

1722
01:14:41,977 --> 01:14:45,731
‪That was because Kyung-ho chose Ye-rim,

1723
01:14:45,814 --> 01:14:47,232
‪and you had something going on too.

1724
01:14:48,358 --> 01:14:49,651
‪-Okay.
‪-Because of those things,

1725
01:14:49,735 --> 01:14:50,903
‪I went to Ga-yeon.

1726
01:14:50,986 --> 01:14:54,072
‪How do you think Ga-yeon feels?

1727
01:14:54,615 --> 01:14:58,577
‪I think she is most interested in me.

1728
01:14:58,660 --> 01:14:59,578
‪-You feel it?
‪-Yeah.

1729
01:15:00,496 --> 01:15:01,371
‪We spent time together.

1730
01:15:01,455 --> 01:15:02,831
‪You move around the house, right?

1731
01:15:03,415 --> 01:15:06,210
‪The path she tends to take?

1732
01:15:06,293 --> 01:15:08,128
‪-What is that?
‪-I feel like

1733
01:15:08,212 --> 01:15:10,506
‪-we follow each other around.
‪-You?

1734
01:15:10,589 --> 01:15:12,382
‪I follow Ga-yeon around,

1735
01:15:12,466 --> 01:15:14,092
‪-and she follows me around.
‪-How cute.

1736
01:15:14,176 --> 01:15:15,719
‪Her feelings for me are the biggest.

1737
01:15:16,261 --> 01:15:18,805
‪Do you have confidence
‪in one another?

1738
01:15:18,889 --> 01:15:19,765
‪I think so.

1739
01:15:20,807 --> 01:15:22,518
‪We talked about it too.

1740
01:15:23,101 --> 01:15:25,562
‪Do you think Ga-yeon has a second choice?

1741
01:15:25,646 --> 01:15:26,813
‪I think so.

1742
01:15:26,897 --> 01:15:27,731
‪Who?

1743
01:15:28,982 --> 01:15:29,983
‪I don't know.

1744
01:15:30,901 --> 01:15:32,444
‪Who's your second choice?

1745
01:15:32,528 --> 01:15:33,862
‪That's a secret.

1746
01:15:33,946 --> 01:15:35,155
‪Between us?

1747
01:15:35,239 --> 01:15:37,491
‪-The shellfish digging duo?
‪-The shellfish digging duo?

1748
01:15:39,201 --> 01:15:41,370
‪I came here with you today, right?

1749
01:15:42,663 --> 01:15:43,747
‪It was fun.

1750
01:15:45,165 --> 01:15:46,375
‪I had fun too.

1751
01:15:48,627 --> 01:15:50,879
‪Seriously though, after today,

1752
01:15:50,963 --> 01:15:54,049
‪I did think that you are
‪a really good person.

1753
01:15:54,883 --> 01:15:55,717
‪I'm serious.

1754
01:15:56,677 --> 01:15:59,096
‪-Come on, guys.
‪-You know what?

1755
01:15:59,179 --> 01:16:02,182
‪They'll start dating after the show
‪and leave everyone in shock.

1756
01:16:03,976 --> 01:16:05,060
‪They get along well.

1757
01:16:05,143 --> 01:16:06,853
‪Feelings might develop later on.

1758
01:16:08,021 --> 01:16:09,690
‪Who do you think will become king?

1759
01:16:09,773 --> 01:16:11,108
‪-Ga-yeon.
‪-Why?

1760
01:16:11,733 --> 01:16:14,486
‪She is many guys' second choice,

1761
01:16:15,571 --> 01:16:17,281
‪so I think she'll get

1762
01:16:17,364 --> 01:16:18,782
‪a lot of votes from the men.

1763
01:16:18,865 --> 01:16:21,702
‪Who knows?
‪Ga-yeon's date may have gone well today.

1764
01:16:23,245 --> 01:16:24,538
‪That is possible.

1765
01:16:25,163 --> 01:16:26,290
‪How do you feel?

1766
01:16:26,373 --> 01:16:30,043
‪It would be shocking
‪if her first choice changed.

1767
01:16:30,127 --> 01:16:31,920
‪-Would it really be shocking?
‪-Yeah.

1768
01:16:32,421 --> 01:16:35,048
‪-I doubt that will happen, though.
‪-Okay.

1769
01:16:35,132 --> 01:16:36,925
‪I don't think it will change.

1770
01:16:38,093 --> 01:16:39,177
‪I'm sure it won't.

1771
01:16:40,971 --> 01:16:41,805
‪HYE-WON & HA-YOON

1772
01:16:41,888 --> 01:16:44,057
‪Let's go.

1773
01:16:44,141 --> 01:16:45,934
‪Aren't you driving too fast?

1774
01:16:47,060 --> 01:16:48,270
‪I'm so happy.

1775
01:16:48,353 --> 01:16:50,230
‪-I'm so excited.
‪-Me too.

1776
01:16:50,814 --> 01:16:53,942
‪The reason why the algorithm
‪keeps suggesting it is--

1777
01:16:54,026 --> 01:16:55,110
‪Darn it.

1778
01:16:55,193 --> 01:16:56,445
‪-Wrong turn.
‪-It's okay.

1779
01:16:56,528 --> 01:16:58,113
‪I shouldn't go this way.

1780
01:16:58,697 --> 01:17:01,366
‪We got in the car, but I was nervous,

1781
01:17:01,450 --> 01:17:05,454
‪so I kept making the wrong turn.

1782
01:17:05,537 --> 01:17:07,247
‪Should I be quiet
‪until we get to the coastal road?

1783
01:17:07,331 --> 01:17:08,540
‪Yeah. Hush.

1784
01:17:09,499 --> 01:17:11,460
‪So I told him to be quiet.

1785
01:17:11,543 --> 01:17:13,211
‪I couldn't focus.

1786
01:17:13,795 --> 01:17:15,547
‪-Let's not talk.
‪-Okay.

1787
01:17:16,256 --> 01:17:17,341
‪Let's talk a lot

1788
01:17:17,424 --> 01:17:19,259
‪-when you don't have to drive.
‪-Yeah.

1789
01:17:20,427 --> 01:17:21,386
‪I'll be quiet.

1790
01:17:21,470 --> 01:17:23,263
‪I have to focus.

1791
01:17:23,972 --> 01:17:26,892
‪Ha-yoon said sorry and just stayed still.

1792
01:17:27,476 --> 01:17:29,186
‪But then he started talking again.

1793
01:17:29,269 --> 01:17:31,688
‪What a fun start.

1794
01:17:31,772 --> 01:17:33,148
‪-Yeah.
‪-Are you okay? I mean, driving.

1795
01:17:33,231 --> 01:17:34,566
‪-I'm fine with driving.
‪-There's a lot to focus on.

1796
01:17:34,650 --> 01:17:36,526
‪But I don't think I can talk.

1797
01:17:36,610 --> 01:17:38,945
‪-I'll let you focus.
‪-Oh my gosh.

1798
01:17:39,529 --> 01:17:41,239
<i>‪Actually, I can't multitask.</i>

1799
01:17:42,658 --> 01:17:45,160
‪Can we make it back home today?

1800
01:17:48,205 --> 01:17:50,040
<i>‪We'll be doing ceramic painting.</i>

1801
01:17:51,583 --> 01:17:52,417
‪What will you do?

1802
01:17:52,501 --> 01:17:54,878
‪-There's a teddy bear.
‪-There are so many options.

1803
01:17:54,961 --> 01:17:56,546
‪I love teddy bears.

1804
01:17:56,630 --> 01:17:58,423
‪Can you drink
‪the hot-and-cold drink in this?

1805
01:17:59,007 --> 01:18:00,050
‪Hot-and-cold drink?

1806
01:18:00,133 --> 01:18:02,302
‪-Drink it in this.
‪-Do you really want me to drink it?

1807
01:18:02,386 --> 01:18:05,222
‪-Do you really want me to do that?
‪-You can drink from this.

1808
01:18:05,305 --> 01:18:06,640
‪Maybe it'll be too difficult.

1809
01:18:08,141 --> 01:18:10,894
‪What should we draw?

1810
01:18:10,977 --> 01:18:13,105
‪I don't think about it before I begin.

1811
01:18:14,314 --> 01:18:15,524
‪Do you

1812
01:18:17,025 --> 01:18:20,570
‪have someone besides me
‪that you're interested in?

1813
01:18:21,655 --> 01:18:24,366
‪To be honest, there's no one.

1814
01:18:25,325 --> 01:18:28,787
‪Well, we'll have to talk more today,

1815
01:18:28,870 --> 01:18:30,831
‪but the more I talk with you,

1816
01:18:30,914 --> 01:18:34,126
‪you have many qualities that I like.

1817
01:18:34,209 --> 01:18:40,090
‪You have a lot of qualities
‪that I find attractive.

1818
01:18:40,173 --> 01:18:41,174
‪For me,

1819
01:18:42,509 --> 01:18:44,261
‪there's no one else right now.

1820
01:18:47,013 --> 01:18:49,725
‪I want to ask you the same question.

1821
01:18:49,808 --> 01:18:51,226
‪Are you curious?

1822
01:18:51,309 --> 01:18:52,769
‪Yes, I am curious.

1823
01:18:53,395 --> 01:18:55,188
‪-I'll let you know.
‪-Hello.

1824
01:18:55,772 --> 01:18:57,941
‪THE WORKSHOP TOOLS ARRIVE

1825
01:18:58,525 --> 01:19:01,111
‪When I told her
‪my first choice has already been decided

1826
01:19:01,194 --> 01:19:04,823
‪and I am not interested in anyone else,

1827
01:19:04,906 --> 01:19:06,408
<i>‪the instructor showed up,</i>

1828
01:19:06,491 --> 01:19:08,535
<i>‪so I wasn't able to ask her that question.</i>

1829
01:19:08,618 --> 01:19:10,537
‪-Yes, thank you.
‪-Okay.

1830
01:19:11,747 --> 01:19:13,582
‪-Your answer…
‪-Right.

1831
01:19:13,665 --> 01:19:15,417
‪You must wonder. I'll tell you.

1832
01:19:15,500 --> 01:19:17,544
‪-Later?
‪-I have something to tell you too.

1833
01:19:17,627 --> 01:19:18,795
‪Okay. Me too.

1834
01:19:20,505 --> 01:19:22,924
‪-We have to decide what to draw first.
‪-Yeah.

1835
01:19:23,508 --> 01:19:27,679
‪When I talk with you,
‪my voice becomes very relaxed

1836
01:19:27,763 --> 01:19:29,723
‪and it becomes softer too.

1837
01:19:29,806 --> 01:19:30,724
‪Really?

1838
01:19:31,224 --> 01:19:32,058
‪It's interesting.

1839
01:19:32,642 --> 01:19:34,227
‪-You feel relaxed, right?
‪-Yeah, I do.

1840
01:19:34,311 --> 01:19:35,270
‪That's what matters.

1841
01:19:38,356 --> 01:19:40,567
‪-This is harder than I expected.
‪-Yeah.

1842
01:19:41,151 --> 01:19:43,361
‪I'm drawing this while thinking of you.

1843
01:19:43,445 --> 01:19:46,239
‪Of course, I have something in mind too.

1844
01:19:47,866 --> 01:19:50,535
‪-This is so pretty.
‪-It's like a piece of art.

1845
01:19:50,619 --> 01:19:51,787
‪You're good.

1846
01:19:56,208 --> 01:19:58,919
‪It looks really dumb but cute.

1847
01:19:59,002 --> 01:20:00,962
‪-I want to see it up close.
‪-Let me explain it.

1848
01:20:01,046 --> 01:20:03,048
‪There's a meaning to it. And it's obvious.

1849
01:20:03,131 --> 01:20:05,217
‪-Wait, I know what it is.
‪-Right.

1850
01:20:05,300 --> 01:20:08,261
‪It's you, me, and the others.

1851
01:20:08,345 --> 01:20:09,221
‪Yeah.

1852
01:20:09,763 --> 01:20:13,475
‪You always say that you're calm, right?

1853
01:20:13,558 --> 01:20:16,353
‪I feel like you're slowly
‪rubbing off on me.

1854
01:20:16,436 --> 01:20:18,814
‪So that's what I tried to portray.

1855
01:20:19,439 --> 01:20:21,233
‪One, two, three.

1856
01:20:25,862 --> 01:20:27,280
‪HYE-WON & HA-YOON
‪OSTERIA FONTANA

1857
01:20:27,364 --> 01:20:29,366
<i>‪-Let's enjoy our meal.</i>
<i>‪-Yeah.</i>

1858
01:20:29,449 --> 01:20:31,117
‪-Thank you.
‪-Thank you.

1859
01:20:32,369 --> 01:20:33,370
‪Oh my.

1860
01:20:35,080 --> 01:20:36,456
‪It looks delicious.

1861
01:20:39,793 --> 01:20:41,127
‪It's so good.

1862
01:20:41,711 --> 01:20:43,213
‪-It's tasty.
‪-It is?

1863
01:20:43,839 --> 01:20:46,258
‪Let's continue what we were
‪talking about.

1864
01:20:47,133 --> 01:20:48,468
‪May I ask you?

1865
01:20:48,552 --> 01:20:51,054
‪Did you know that I already knew Kyung-ho?

1866
01:20:51,137 --> 01:20:52,222
‪-You knew?
‪-Yeah.

1867
01:20:52,305 --> 01:20:55,725
‪Because I like dance so much,
‪I already knew Kyung-ho.

1868
01:20:55,809 --> 01:20:58,895
‪So I was curious about him.

1869
01:20:58,979 --> 01:21:02,941
‪But I realized it was just as a fan.

1870
01:21:04,192 --> 01:21:07,779
‪It wasn't something romantic with him.

1871
01:21:07,863 --> 01:21:09,698
‪I was able to confirm that,

1872
01:21:10,282 --> 01:21:12,909
‪so I'm not interested in anyone else.

1873
01:21:14,327 --> 01:21:15,453
‪So,

1874
01:21:16,621 --> 01:21:18,832
‪you're the only one for me now.

1875
01:21:23,253 --> 01:21:27,632
‪It’s been a really long time
‪since someone looked me

1876
01:21:27,716 --> 01:21:31,052
‪in the eyes calmly and sincerely say,

1877
01:21:31,136 --> 01:21:34,306
‪"I want to go

1878
01:21:34,389 --> 01:21:36,975
‪on a date with you."

1879
01:21:38,310 --> 01:21:42,439
‪I want to go on a date with you.

1880
01:21:43,023 --> 01:21:43,899
‪That's how I feel.

1881
01:21:43,982 --> 01:21:45,442
‪-That sounds good.
‪-Yeah.

1882
01:21:45,525 --> 01:21:48,236
‪Okay, that has been

1883
01:21:48,320 --> 01:21:49,279
‪registered in my head.

1884
01:21:49,905 --> 01:21:55,410
‪I was very sleepy and exhausted,

1885
01:21:55,493 --> 01:21:58,747
‪but I was so deeply moved by that.

1886
01:21:58,830 --> 01:22:02,584
‪And I saw a spark in his eyes too.

1887
01:22:03,960 --> 01:22:05,378
‪It was so bright.

1888
01:22:05,962 --> 01:22:07,505
‪-It was so touching.
‪-Really?

1889
01:22:07,589 --> 01:22:09,299
‪But wasn't I really unkempt?

1890
01:22:09,382 --> 01:22:13,053
‪It was the best line to me.

1891
01:22:13,136 --> 01:22:14,095
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

1892
01:22:17,766 --> 01:22:20,727
‪Gosh, jeez…

1893
01:22:21,478 --> 01:22:22,854
‪What's wrong? Are you feeling shy?

1894
01:22:23,438 --> 01:22:24,481
‪I think I am feeling shy.

1895
01:22:24,564 --> 01:22:27,943
‪The way you were able to talk about that

1896
01:22:28,026 --> 01:22:33,573
‪with such sincerity, but without making it
‪pushy or overwhelming…

1897
01:22:35,825 --> 01:22:36,660
‪My heart skipped a beat.

1898
01:22:38,453 --> 01:22:39,663
‪Cheers.

1899
01:22:40,330 --> 01:22:41,331
‪Cheers.

1900
01:22:47,253 --> 01:22:48,296
‪Am I blushing?

1901
01:22:48,922 --> 01:22:49,756
‪Not really.

1902
01:22:51,716 --> 01:22:55,345
<i>‪To me, Hye-won sparkles.</i>

1903
01:22:56,012 --> 01:22:59,891
<i>‪For one thing, her eyes are so big</i>
<i>‪that they sparkle.</i>

1904
01:22:59,975 --> 01:23:04,062
‪Because she bounces
‪from one subject to another,

1905
01:23:04,145 --> 01:23:08,024
‪she may come across as rambling
‪or a little all over the place.

1906
01:23:08,108 --> 01:23:10,527
‪But when she talks about
‪something she knows

1907
01:23:10,610 --> 01:23:12,612
‪and feels strongly about,

1908
01:23:12,696 --> 01:23:16,282
<i>‪her eyes sparkle with confidence.</i>

1909
01:23:17,575 --> 01:23:19,369
‪He seems to accommodate me in every way.

1910
01:23:19,452 --> 01:23:21,579
‪When I'm talking about something,

1911
01:23:21,663 --> 01:23:25,000
‪he would go along with my conversation.

1912
01:23:25,083 --> 01:23:27,168
‪I love that so much.

1913
01:23:27,252 --> 01:23:30,672
‪I feel like my feelings for him
‪are gradually getting stronger.

1914
01:23:31,423 --> 01:23:33,049
‪Thank you for coming on a date with me.

1915
01:23:33,133 --> 01:23:35,218
‪Well, I wanted to come.

1916
01:23:35,301 --> 01:23:36,136
‪Okay.

1917
01:23:37,262 --> 01:23:38,388
‪That's a shame.

1918
01:23:38,471 --> 01:23:42,017
‪Ha-yoon and Hye-won seem like they're set.

1919
01:23:42,100 --> 01:23:44,060
‪That's why it's a shame.
‪I wanted to give it a shot at him.

1920
01:23:46,021 --> 01:23:48,523
‪YE-RIM & DO-GEON
‪PORK MOUNTAIN

1921
01:23:48,606 --> 01:23:49,983
‪Hey, there's a dog.

1922
01:23:50,066 --> 01:23:51,901
‪-Awesome.
‪-No way.

1923
01:23:52,652 --> 01:23:54,446
‪It's waiting so patiently.
‪What a sweet dog.

1924
01:23:54,529 --> 01:23:56,322
‪-It's waiting for us.
‪-I know.

1925
01:23:57,115 --> 01:23:58,533
‪Come here.

1926
01:23:58,616 --> 01:23:59,617
‪No way.

1927
01:23:59,701 --> 01:24:01,036
‪Come over here.

1928
01:24:01,119 --> 01:24:02,370
‪Where did you go? Come here.

1929
01:24:02,454 --> 01:24:03,580
‪Hello.

1930
01:24:04,205 --> 01:24:05,623
‪How adorable.

1931
01:24:05,707 --> 01:24:07,625
‪Look at its eyes. Looks so smart.

1932
01:24:08,334 --> 01:24:09,544
‪I'll start grilling.

1933
01:24:10,295 --> 01:24:11,588
‪Do you trust me?

1934
01:24:11,671 --> 01:24:12,589
‪Of course.

1935
01:24:14,007 --> 01:24:15,633
‪-It looks good.
‪-It does.

1936
01:24:15,717 --> 01:24:17,177
‪-Now that I see it…
‪-I know.

1937
01:24:17,761 --> 01:24:18,762
‪It looks good.

1938
01:24:19,512 --> 01:24:20,388
‪Try one.

1939
01:24:27,604 --> 01:24:28,480
‪Is it hot?

1940
01:24:31,232 --> 01:24:32,692
‪-It's tasty.
‪-Is it?

1941
01:24:33,526 --> 01:24:35,570
‪-Would you like a wrap?
‪-That would be nice.

1942
01:24:42,285 --> 01:24:43,411
‪Nice wrap.

1943
01:24:43,495 --> 01:24:44,329
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

1944
01:24:44,412 --> 01:24:45,538
‪-Was it good?
‪-It's good.

1945
01:24:46,122 --> 01:24:46,998
‪It's all done.

1946
01:24:47,832 --> 01:24:49,209
‪Thank you.

1947
01:24:49,793 --> 01:24:51,503
‪-Shall we clink our glasses?
‪-Yes.

1948
01:24:59,260 --> 01:25:00,720
‪-What if
‪-Yeah?

1949
01:25:00,804 --> 01:25:02,931
‪Chae-rin's mind changed today?

1950
01:25:03,515 --> 01:25:05,225
‪Do you still want to
‪go out with her tomorrow?

1951
01:25:05,975 --> 01:25:07,060
‪-Of course.
‪-Really?

1952
01:25:07,143 --> 01:25:09,229
‪If she changed her mind today,
‪I can--

1953
01:25:09,312 --> 01:25:10,688
‪Change it back tomorrow?

1954
01:25:10,772 --> 01:25:11,815
‪I have to change it back.

1955
01:25:12,524 --> 01:25:14,859
‪That's all the more reason
‪to go on a date with her tomorrow.

1956
01:25:15,985 --> 01:25:17,445
‪If she changed her mind…

1957
01:25:18,029 --> 01:25:19,072
‪Not me.

1958
01:25:19,697 --> 01:25:21,491
‪If they like someone more than me…

1959
01:25:25,328 --> 01:25:28,832
‪It could be because he's not
‪spending time with you today.

1960
01:25:28,915 --> 01:25:30,250
‪-You're right.
‪-Yeah.

1961
01:25:30,750 --> 01:25:32,585
‪-You never know.
‪-Yeah.

1962
01:25:32,669 --> 01:25:35,130
‪Okay. I want to go out
‪with Kyung-ho tomorrow too.

1963
01:25:35,213 --> 01:25:39,175
‪Yeah, you should win him back
‪when you go on that date.

1964
01:25:39,676 --> 01:25:41,219
‪You can't change a guy's mind.

1965
01:25:41,302 --> 01:25:43,471
‪Why do you think that?

1966
01:25:44,055 --> 01:25:44,889
‪Speaking from experience.

1967
01:25:46,683 --> 01:25:48,518
‪I talked to Ga-yeon

1968
01:25:48,601 --> 01:25:49,978
‪-while we were outside.
‪-In the tent?

1969
01:25:50,061 --> 01:25:53,606
‪Kyung-ho came and pulled Ga-yeon aside
‪to have a chat with her.

1970
01:25:54,190 --> 01:25:55,817
‪You said earlier that he didn't!

1971
01:25:57,152 --> 01:25:58,111
‪He did.

1972
01:25:58,194 --> 01:25:59,779
‪Really?

1973
01:25:59,863 --> 01:26:01,156
‪-Briefly.
‪-And?

1974
01:26:02,407 --> 01:26:03,700
‪So…

1975
01:26:03,783 --> 01:26:06,411
‪That's the first time Ga-yeon knew.

1976
01:26:06,494 --> 01:26:07,495
‪Knew what?

1977
01:26:07,579 --> 01:26:08,997
‪That Kyung-ho is…

1978
01:26:09,080 --> 01:26:11,708
‪-Curious about her?
‪-Yeah, that he's curious about her.

1979
01:26:13,001 --> 01:26:14,127
‪That's when she first found out.

1980
01:26:14,752 --> 01:26:16,171
‪All right, then.

1981
01:26:17,422 --> 01:26:21,384
‪I don't think she had any interest in him

1982
01:26:22,218 --> 01:26:23,178
‪until then.

1983
01:26:23,761 --> 01:26:25,555
‪-You're wrong.
‪-I'm wrong?

1984
01:26:25,638 --> 01:26:27,056
‪-You got it all wrong.
‪-I did?

1985
01:26:27,140 --> 01:26:28,016
‪Totally wrong.

1986
01:26:28,099 --> 01:26:29,058
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

1987
01:26:29,142 --> 01:26:31,477
‪I can see that Kyung-ho
‪is curious about Ga-yeon,

1988
01:26:31,561 --> 01:26:33,855
‪and I can see
‪Ga-yeon reacting to that too.

1989
01:26:33,938 --> 01:26:36,107
‪-I see.
‪-Totally.

1990
01:26:37,442 --> 01:26:41,112
‪I'm so curious how it will go today.

1991
01:26:41,196 --> 01:26:43,198
‪I'm curious,
‪but I also don't want to find out.

1992
01:26:43,281 --> 01:26:44,699
‪I'm curious but afraid.

1993
01:26:44,782 --> 01:26:46,492
‪-Scared of getting hurt?
‪-Yeah.

1994
01:26:47,619 --> 01:26:48,453
‪Yeah.

1995
01:26:49,120 --> 01:26:51,873
‪-I get you.
‪-What do I do if I get hurt?

1996
01:26:51,956 --> 01:26:55,668
‪Are you going to give up
‪without even trying,

1997
01:26:55,752 --> 01:26:58,254
‪or are you going to try and get hurt?

1998
01:26:58,838 --> 01:27:01,466
‪If it were you,

1999
01:27:01,549 --> 01:27:05,220
‪you would try to change Chae-rin's mind
‪even if she chose someone else.

2000
01:27:05,303 --> 01:27:06,679
‪I have to change her mind.

2001
01:27:06,763 --> 01:27:08,598
‪Where do you get that kind of courage?

2002
01:27:08,681 --> 01:27:09,682
‪Why not?

2003
01:27:10,558 --> 01:27:11,559
‪Should I give up then?

2004
01:27:12,143 --> 01:27:13,645
‪-You do have a point.
‪-Yeah.

2005
01:27:14,479 --> 01:27:15,438
‪That makes no sense.

2006
01:27:16,147 --> 01:27:17,065
‪You like him.

2007
01:27:18,191 --> 01:27:21,319
‪I like him, but he doesn't like me back.

2008
01:27:21,402 --> 01:27:24,405
‪But it's not like that person
‪wasn't interested in you at all.

2009
01:27:24,489 --> 01:27:25,907
‪-You're right.
‪-Yeah.

2010
01:27:25,990 --> 01:27:28,534
‪If she wasn't interested in me at all
‪from the start,

2011
01:27:28,618 --> 01:27:30,036
‪I wouldn't want to

2012
01:27:30,119 --> 01:27:33,122
‪force my feelings on her.

2013
01:27:33,206 --> 01:27:34,624
‪-You wouldn't?
‪-But you see,

2014
01:27:34,707 --> 01:27:36,084
‪things were going well between us,

2015
01:27:36,167 --> 01:27:38,419
‪so if she starts straying,

2016
01:27:38,503 --> 01:27:40,255
‪I have to get her back.

2017
01:27:40,880 --> 01:27:43,091
‪You should have
‪a real conversation with him tonight.

2018
01:27:45,843 --> 01:27:47,887
‪I hope they get back before we do.

2019
01:27:48,471 --> 01:27:49,472
‪Why?

2020
01:27:49,555 --> 01:27:52,475
‪That way, it'll be easier
‪to feel their vibe

2021
01:27:52,558 --> 01:27:55,019
‪when we get back.

2022
01:27:55,937 --> 01:28:00,400
‪I can see if they are sitting
‪next to each other and things like that.

2023
01:28:00,984 --> 01:28:03,236
‪I was really hoping
‪that Kyung-ho and Ga-yeon

2024
01:28:03,319 --> 01:28:04,612
‪would be back before us.

2025
01:28:04,696 --> 01:28:07,282
‪If they came late,
‪it would mean they had fun.

2026
01:28:07,365 --> 01:28:09,242
‪When I look at Ye-rim,

2027
01:28:09,325 --> 01:28:11,452
‪I see myself in her. I'm like that too.

2028
01:28:11,536 --> 01:28:14,914
‪I'd be like, "It's because I'm too young."

2029
01:28:14,998 --> 01:28:16,958
‪It's so frustrating
‪that I don't want to do that anymore.

2030
01:28:17,041 --> 01:28:18,376
‪There's no need to be like that.

2031
01:28:18,960 --> 01:28:21,462
‪I really miss Chae-rin.

2032
01:28:22,463 --> 01:28:23,506
‪What do I do?

2033
01:28:24,924 --> 01:28:25,842
‪Me too.

2034
01:28:25,925 --> 01:28:27,093
‪Jeez.

2035
01:28:28,011 --> 01:28:30,013
‪Are you going to tell her
‪when you get back?

2036
01:28:30,096 --> 01:28:30,972
‪That you missed her?

2037
01:28:31,055 --> 01:28:32,390
‪Is that how close you are?

2038
01:28:33,725 --> 01:28:34,934
‪I could if I wanted to.

2039
01:28:36,853 --> 01:28:38,104
‪You should say it too.

2040
01:28:38,187 --> 01:28:39,856
‪I could if I wanted to as well.

2041
01:28:39,939 --> 01:28:41,649
‪Yeah, you could if you wanted to.

2042
01:28:42,650 --> 01:28:44,902
‪I wonder how many are back.

2043
01:28:44,986 --> 01:28:45,903
‪Me too.

2044
01:28:46,738 --> 01:28:49,198
‪Oh, there's something I want to ask you.

2045
01:28:49,282 --> 01:28:50,116
‪What is it?

2046
01:28:50,700 --> 01:28:51,576
‪Never mind.

2047
01:28:52,201 --> 01:28:53,578
‪Come on. Tell me.

2048
01:28:54,495 --> 01:28:57,081
‪Ga-yeon got <i>‪chojang</i>‪ on her sleeve.

2049
01:28:57,165 --> 01:28:58,166
<i>‪Chojang.</i>

2050
01:28:58,249 --> 01:28:59,584
‪That's cute.

2051
01:28:59,667 --> 01:29:01,127
‪Who did you vote for yesterday?

2052
01:29:04,172 --> 01:29:05,173
‪Who did I vote for?

2053
01:29:05,923 --> 01:29:07,717
‪Right now,

2054
01:29:08,343 --> 01:29:12,930
‪there are only two people that I have

2055
01:29:13,014 --> 01:29:14,098
‪romantic interest in.

2056
01:29:14,807 --> 01:29:15,975
‪Who are they?

2057
01:29:16,059 --> 01:29:17,810
‪You and Jung-min.

2058
01:29:26,235 --> 01:29:28,112
‪-See? You don't avoid my eye contact.
‪-Huh?

2059
01:29:29,113 --> 01:29:30,656
‪Most people do.

2060
01:29:30,740 --> 01:29:33,242
‪My mom told me that
‪it's rude to avoid eye contact

2061
01:29:33,326 --> 01:29:35,370
‪and that I should look at them
‪when you talk to them.

2062
01:29:40,708 --> 01:29:42,585
‪Do you do that to everyone?

2063
01:29:42,668 --> 01:29:45,088
‪-Oh, in here?
‪-Yeah.

2064
01:29:45,171 --> 01:29:46,255
‪No, not really.

2065
01:29:46,756 --> 01:29:48,800
‪Didn't our eyes meet quite often?

2066
01:29:48,883 --> 01:29:49,717
‪-Us?
‪-Yeah.

2067
01:29:49,801 --> 01:29:51,302
‪-Yeah.
‪-Right?

2068
01:29:51,385 --> 01:29:52,970
‪I must've been looking at you a lot.

2069
01:29:53,054 --> 01:29:54,931
‪-Really?
‪-Well,

2070
01:29:55,932 --> 01:29:56,808
‪didn't you say that

2071
01:29:57,600 --> 01:29:59,644
‪-your gaze kept drifting toward me?
‪-Yeah.

2072
01:29:59,727 --> 01:30:01,062
‪I must've been like that too.

2073
01:30:01,145 --> 01:30:02,271
‪It was like that for me too.

2074
01:30:06,776 --> 01:30:10,154
‪When I look at someone,
‪I don't avoid eye contact.

2075
01:30:10,238 --> 01:30:12,615
‪But he looks into my eyes
‪longer than I look at his.

2076
01:30:17,787 --> 01:30:19,413
<i>‪When our eyes locked,</i>

2077
01:30:19,497 --> 01:30:21,165
‪my heart skipped a beat.

2078
01:30:21,249 --> 01:30:22,875
<i>‪He captivates me.</i>

2079
01:30:27,296 --> 01:30:28,172
<i>‪My heart</i>

2080
01:30:29,090 --> 01:30:30,341
‪kind of skipped a beat.

2081
01:30:31,759 --> 01:30:33,302
‪They said the same thing.

2082
01:30:34,846 --> 01:30:37,390
‪I love this.

2083
01:30:38,182 --> 01:30:39,058
‪"Skipped a beat."

2084
01:30:39,142 --> 01:30:42,311
‪I could feel butterflies in my stomach.

2085
01:30:43,104 --> 01:30:46,732
‪All the constellations show up like this.

2086
01:30:46,816 --> 01:30:48,192
‪Then, you find your star sign.

2087
01:30:48,276 --> 01:30:51,612
<i>‪I was kind of in a daze.</i>

2088
01:30:52,196 --> 01:30:54,407
<i>‪It was pretty hot in the car too.</i>

2089
01:30:55,366 --> 01:30:57,994
‪It felt like I was moving like this
‪while we were talking,

2090
01:30:58,995 --> 01:31:01,539
<i>‪so I don't even remember what I said.</i>

2091
01:31:01,622 --> 01:31:03,416
‪-The Big Dipper?
‪-Yeah, the Big Dipper.

2092
01:31:05,543 --> 01:31:06,627
‪And?

2093
01:31:07,420 --> 01:31:12,258
‪How I feel for you has become clearer.

2094
01:31:12,341 --> 01:31:14,135
‪I don't know exactly when,

2095
01:31:15,344 --> 01:31:17,513
‪but it became clear before I knew it.

2096
01:31:18,014 --> 01:31:21,559
‪It felt like the things that weighed on me
‪were finally lifted.

2097
01:31:21,642 --> 01:31:23,019
‪I felt released.

2098
01:31:23,102 --> 01:31:24,979
‪Who do you want to go out with tomorrow?

2099
01:31:25,062 --> 01:31:25,980
‪The date?

2100
01:31:26,480 --> 01:31:27,815
‪I think I'll go out with you.

2101
01:31:27,899 --> 01:31:30,151
‪Really? You think you will?

2102
01:31:30,818 --> 01:31:31,652
‪Yeah.

2103
01:31:32,445 --> 01:31:33,696
‪How?

2104
01:31:33,779 --> 01:31:35,573
‪The king will make it happen.

2105
01:31:36,073 --> 01:31:37,158
‪Who's the king?

2106
01:31:37,950 --> 01:31:38,784
‪Me?

2107
01:31:38,868 --> 01:31:39,702
‪You?

2108
01:31:41,537 --> 01:31:43,497
‪Who would you like to be king?

2109
01:31:43,581 --> 01:31:44,415
‪Me?

2110
01:31:44,498 --> 01:31:45,333
‪You?

2111
01:31:46,500 --> 01:31:48,461
‪That way, I can find out how you feel.

2112
01:31:48,544 --> 01:31:50,129
‪I don't want to ask you directly.

2113
01:31:50,630 --> 01:31:52,673
‪But I do want to know.

2114
01:31:52,757 --> 01:31:55,009
‪Of course, I want to know how you feel.

2115
01:31:55,092 --> 01:31:57,637
‪But I don't want to ask you upfront.

2116
01:31:57,720 --> 01:31:58,554
‪Not yet.

2117
01:31:59,889 --> 01:32:03,100
‪Who you end up choosing

2118
01:32:03,184 --> 01:32:07,271
‪may make me sad or happy. Who knows?

2119
01:32:11,525 --> 01:32:14,528
‪I think my head is going to hurt now.

2120
01:32:15,988 --> 01:32:19,492
‪You're going to sigh 30 to 50 times.

2121
01:32:19,575 --> 01:32:22,495
‪I'm going to be a depressed Ga-yeon.

2122
01:32:22,578 --> 01:32:23,496
‪Depressed Ga-yeon?

2123
01:32:25,122 --> 01:32:31,212
<i>‪When do I have to make up my mind</i>
<i>‪and let you know?</i>

2124
01:32:31,295 --> 01:32:32,630
<i>‪You aren't sure yet?</i>

2125
01:32:32,713 --> 01:32:34,507
‪I think I know how I feel now.

2126
01:32:35,216 --> 01:32:38,636
‪You went on a date with both women.

2127
01:32:38,719 --> 01:32:40,471
‪That's right. I have.

2128
01:32:40,554 --> 01:32:41,973
‪I've only gone out with you.

2129
01:32:43,349 --> 01:32:44,308
‪That's right.

2130
01:32:45,184 --> 01:32:49,063
‪When your mind is made up,

2131
01:32:49,146 --> 01:32:51,857
‪will you tell Ye-rim or me?

2132
01:32:51,941 --> 01:32:55,736
‪It may not be right away,
‪but I'll say it as soon as I can.

2133
01:32:55,820 --> 01:32:58,072
‪You already went

2134
01:32:58,155 --> 01:33:00,449
‪-on two dates.
‪-I went on two dates.

2135
01:33:00,533 --> 01:33:03,661
‪You may have a lot of time, but I…

2136
01:33:03,744 --> 01:33:05,204
‪All right.

2137
01:33:06,831 --> 01:33:09,959
‪-Why can't I see their hands?
‪-What's that angle?

2138
01:33:10,543 --> 01:33:11,877
‪-You should've lowered it.
‪-Yeah.

2139
01:33:11,961 --> 01:33:13,629
‪I can't see even from this angle.

2140
01:33:14,672 --> 01:33:15,589
‪This is driving me crazy.

2141
01:33:16,173 --> 01:33:19,260
‪You may have a lot of time, but I…

2142
01:33:19,343 --> 01:33:20,720
‪All right.

2143
01:33:22,763 --> 01:33:23,848
‪I get it.

2144
01:33:24,473 --> 01:33:26,517
‪It would be nice if we could
‪go out again tomorrow.

2145
01:33:26,600 --> 01:33:27,560
‪No?

2146
01:33:30,146 --> 01:33:31,564
‪Do what your heart tells you.

2147
01:33:38,612 --> 01:33:42,700
‪If you can go on a date
‪with Jung-min tomorrow,

2148
01:33:43,367 --> 01:33:45,119
‪it wouldn't be a bad idea to go.

2149
01:33:45,202 --> 01:33:49,040
‪I'd be sad and in pain,
‪and I'd want to punch him,

2150
01:33:50,124 --> 01:33:50,958
‪but…

2151
01:33:52,710 --> 01:33:54,837
‪Who knows? I may not like you tomorrow.

2152
01:33:55,629 --> 01:33:56,756
‪I'm just kidding.

2153
01:33:58,466 --> 01:34:01,510
‪In a way,

2154
01:34:01,594 --> 01:34:05,681
‪I feel like
‪I'm casually seeing two people.

2155
01:34:05,765 --> 01:34:08,184
‪Doesn't it feel very bizarre?

2156
01:34:08,267 --> 01:34:13,773
‪Yeah, but I'm not in a place
‪where I can make a decision yet

2157
01:34:14,523 --> 01:34:19,403
‪because I haven't had
‪a conversation like this with Jung-min.

2158
01:34:19,487 --> 01:34:20,321
‪Do it today.

2159
01:34:21,447 --> 01:34:22,490
‪-How?
‪-Well,

2160
01:34:23,282 --> 01:34:24,575
‪have a long conversation today.

2161
01:34:25,785 --> 01:34:26,952
‪Find a place to do it.

2162
01:34:27,703 --> 01:34:28,788
‪I don't know.

2163
01:34:30,998 --> 01:34:32,625
‪From the start, what if I…

2164
01:34:33,292 --> 01:34:36,087
‪From the very start, when we arrived…

2165
01:34:36,712 --> 01:34:40,925
‪what if I were only interested in you,
‪only talked to you,

2166
01:34:41,008 --> 01:34:42,426
‪only looked at you,

2167
01:34:43,135 --> 01:34:44,970
‪said, "I only want to go out with you…"

2168
01:34:48,224 --> 01:34:49,392
‪and held your hand and stuff?

2169
01:34:54,897 --> 01:34:56,273
‪Would things have been different?

2170
01:34:57,274 --> 01:34:58,359
‪Yeah, completely.

2171
01:34:59,860 --> 01:35:00,694
‪That was

2172
01:35:01,445 --> 01:35:02,696
‪huge for me.

2173
01:35:02,780 --> 01:35:06,909
‪At first, I wasn't interested in Jung-min

2174
01:35:08,369 --> 01:35:09,370
‪at all.

2175
01:35:09,453 --> 01:35:10,871
‪So that played a huge part.

2176
01:35:12,123 --> 01:35:17,503
‪Yeah, holding hands was

2177
01:35:19,004 --> 01:35:20,131
‪very big for me.

2178
01:35:20,214 --> 01:35:21,048
‪It really was.

2179
01:35:21,132 --> 01:35:24,468
‪I didn't expect it at all.

2180
01:35:27,763 --> 01:35:29,140
‪CHAE-RIN AND JUNG-MIN ARE BACK

2181
01:35:29,223 --> 01:35:30,349
‪THE SHELLFISH THEY DUG UP

2182
01:35:30,433 --> 01:35:32,351
‪I feel like we have too many.

2183
01:35:33,853 --> 01:35:36,730
‪THEY SOAK THEM AS SOON AS THEY GET BACK

2184
01:35:36,814 --> 01:35:38,816
‪-Done.
‪-Good.

2185
01:35:38,899 --> 01:35:42,403
‪I wonder how the date
‪will affect the Heart Chip vote today.

2186
01:35:42,486 --> 01:35:44,238
‪I wonder who will become king.

2187
01:35:44,321 --> 01:35:47,366
‪-I'm curious.
‪-I have to be king.

2188
01:35:47,450 --> 01:35:48,742
‪YE-RIM AND DO-GEON ARRIVE

2189
01:35:48,826 --> 01:35:50,286
‪-Look at the stars.
‪-Where?

2190
01:35:53,539 --> 01:35:54,957
‪Look at the stars and make a wish.

2191
01:36:00,796 --> 01:36:01,797
‪I made mine.

2192
01:36:01,881 --> 01:36:04,550
‪-What did you wish for?
‪-I wished for things to work out well.

2193
01:36:04,633 --> 01:36:06,260
‪-Hahaha.
‪-Hahaha.

2194
01:36:06,343 --> 01:36:07,761
‪You're a romantic boy.

2195
01:36:10,514 --> 01:36:12,725
‪-What if no one's here?
‪-Right?

2196
01:36:12,808 --> 01:36:14,143
‪-What?
‪-What?

2197
01:36:14,226 --> 01:36:15,060
‪You're back.

2198
01:36:15,144 --> 01:36:16,896
‪-Did you have fun?
‪-Did you?

2199
01:36:16,979 --> 01:36:18,105
‪-Me?
‪-Yeah.

2200
01:36:19,106 --> 01:36:20,649
‪I guess I had fun.

2201
01:36:20,733 --> 01:36:22,526
‪-Was the barbecue good?
‪-Yeah.

2202
01:36:22,610 --> 01:36:23,736
‪-He's asleep.
‪-Yeah.

2203
01:36:23,819 --> 01:36:25,237
‪It was totally…

2204
01:36:27,740 --> 01:36:28,741
‪First of all…

2205
01:36:28,824 --> 01:36:29,658
‪BRIEFING ON THE INFO SHE GATHERED

2206
01:36:29,742 --> 01:36:33,662
‪Do-geon is totally into you.
‪Should I put it that way?

2207
01:36:33,746 --> 01:36:35,581
‪-He totally is.
‪-His first choice?

2208
01:36:35,664 --> 01:36:36,957
‪You're totally his first choice.

2209
01:36:37,041 --> 01:36:39,376
‪Surprisingly, his second choice

2210
01:36:39,460 --> 01:36:40,836
‪-is Ga-yeon.
‪-What?

2211
01:36:41,504 --> 01:36:44,256
‪His ideal type is someone talkative.

2212
01:36:45,716 --> 01:36:47,384
‪Someone who is bubbly?

2213
01:36:48,177 --> 01:36:49,595
‪-So--
‪-For real?

2214
01:36:50,221 --> 01:36:51,055
‪I had no idea.

2215
01:36:51,138 --> 01:36:54,391
‪He said he's interested in two people,
‪and Ga-yeon is his second choice.

2216
01:36:54,475 --> 01:36:56,519
‪So he said when he had to choose
‪who to go to the tent with,

2217
01:36:56,602 --> 01:37:01,315
‪he was actually glad
‪that Ga-yeon was able to go.

2218
01:37:03,108 --> 01:37:05,027
‪-He was actually glad?
‪-He was glad.

2219
01:37:05,110 --> 01:37:08,989
‪-Because he hadn't talked to her before.
‪-Really?

2220
01:37:09,073 --> 01:37:10,699
‪I wasn't bothered that he chose Ga-yeon

2221
01:37:10,783 --> 01:37:13,035
‪since they didn't have much interaction.

2222
01:37:13,118 --> 01:37:17,206
‪So I wasn't fazed at all. I didn't care.

2223
01:37:17,289 --> 01:37:19,583
‪But I found out Ga-yeon
‪was his second choice.

2224
01:37:19,667 --> 01:37:22,127
‪He said he didn't choose me

2225
01:37:22,211 --> 01:37:25,130
‪because he thought
‪I wouldn't want to stay in the tent.

2226
01:37:25,214 --> 01:37:27,675
‪I was very touched by that then.

2227
01:37:28,259 --> 01:37:29,385
‪But it turns out, that jerk was…

2228
01:37:30,719 --> 01:37:31,887
‪I had no idea.

2229
01:37:31,971 --> 01:37:34,098
‪I had absolutely no idea either.

2230
01:37:35,599 --> 01:37:37,851
‪After he talked with her,

2231
01:37:37,935 --> 01:37:40,020
‪he said he isn't curious
‪about her anymore.

2232
01:37:41,105 --> 01:37:42,189
‪After talking with her?

2233
01:37:42,273 --> 01:37:44,275
‪He said since tomorrow's date
‪may be the last one,

2234
01:37:44,358 --> 01:37:46,068
‪he definitely wants to go out with you.

2235
01:37:46,652 --> 01:37:49,321
‪He even said that he is a little bothered

2236
01:37:49,405 --> 01:37:51,365
‪about you going on a date with Jung-min.

2237
01:37:52,324 --> 01:37:53,325
‪Really?

2238
01:37:53,409 --> 01:37:54,410
‪FEELING BETTER

2239
01:37:54,493 --> 01:37:58,914
‪When I asked what he would do
‪if Chae-rin changed her mind,

2240
01:37:58,998 --> 01:38:01,375
‪he said he would change it back tomorrow.

2241
01:38:03,043 --> 01:38:04,461
‪-What a man.
‪-Right?

2242
01:38:04,545 --> 01:38:07,256
‪-Tomorrow may be our last.
‪-Date?

2243
01:38:07,339 --> 01:38:11,385
‪-Yes. Then I want to go with Kyung-ho.
‪-You want to go with Kyung-ho?

2244
01:38:12,177 --> 01:38:13,887
‪But you don't know
‪how he feels after today.

2245
01:38:13,971 --> 01:38:15,848
‪I really have no clue.

2246
01:38:15,931 --> 01:38:18,267
‪We are going to chat today anyway.

2247
01:38:18,350 --> 01:38:19,476
‪Make me king.

2248
01:38:19,560 --> 01:38:21,937
‪Because today, I…

2249
01:38:23,564 --> 01:38:24,773
‪-Hi.
‪-Hey.

2250
01:38:24,857 --> 01:38:25,691
‪THE KING HAS RETURNED

2251
01:38:25,774 --> 01:38:27,276
‪-Did you just get back?
‪-Yeah.

2252
01:38:27,359 --> 01:38:28,902
‪Did you enjoy your date? Was it okay?

2253
01:38:28,986 --> 01:38:30,696
‪-Yeah, totally.
‪-Yeah, it was fun.

2254
01:38:30,779 --> 01:38:31,614
‪Thanks to you.

2255
01:38:31,697 --> 01:38:32,698
‪THE KING GOES TO THE BATHROOM

2256
01:38:32,781 --> 01:38:34,241
‪What were we talking about?

2257
01:38:34,325 --> 01:38:36,410
‪-What were we talking about?
‪-Oh, making you…

2258
01:38:37,536 --> 01:38:39,163
‪Did you have a chat with Jung-min?

2259
01:38:39,830 --> 01:38:42,333
‪We went to the mudflat, right?

2260
01:38:46,420 --> 01:38:48,714
‪Is he here?

2261
01:38:49,298 --> 01:38:50,424
‪We made a bet.

2262
01:38:51,675 --> 01:38:54,887
‪We agreed to give the winner
‪Heart Chips for the amount dug up.

2263
01:38:55,596 --> 01:38:58,015
‪-And I dug up over 60 shellfish.
‪-Okay.

2264
01:38:58,098 --> 01:39:00,351
‪-He'll definitely give them to you?
‪-Over 60. Yeah.

2265
01:39:00,434 --> 01:39:02,186
‪Then, I'll concentrate
‪my votes on you too.

2266
01:39:02,269 --> 01:39:05,856
‪I didn't use that many Heart Chips,
‪so I have 237 left.

2267
01:39:06,940 --> 01:39:09,109
‪How can you concentrate yours on mine?

2268
01:39:09,193 --> 01:39:11,737
‪I can give you

2269
01:39:11,820 --> 01:39:12,905
‪about 200.

2270
01:39:16,408 --> 01:39:20,537
‪Wait, but we can only vote
‪for the guys, right?

2271
01:39:20,621 --> 01:39:22,373
‪You're right. What the heck?

2272
01:39:22,456 --> 01:39:24,291
‪You're so cute.

2273
01:39:24,375 --> 01:39:27,252
‪Either me or Ga-yeon
‪will become king today.

2274
01:39:27,336 --> 01:39:29,296
‪We have to keep her in check.

2275
01:39:30,297 --> 01:39:32,466
‪DO-GEON ENTERS

2276
01:39:32,549 --> 01:39:34,510
‪I won the bet today.

2277
01:39:34,593 --> 01:39:36,220
‪I dug up over 60 shellfish.

2278
01:39:37,304 --> 01:39:39,765
‪Do you see how hard I tried?
‪Do you see it?

2279
01:39:42,518 --> 01:39:43,435
‪I love things like this.

2280
01:39:44,061 --> 01:39:46,021
‪-This is what we want to see.
‪-Yeah.

2281
01:39:46,647 --> 01:39:47,564
‪This is what I wanted.

2282
01:39:50,609 --> 01:39:52,236
‪The two should go to the tent today!

2283
01:39:52,319 --> 01:39:55,155
‪Please let them go to the tent. I beg you!

2284
01:39:55,239 --> 01:39:57,783
‪Do you see how hard I tried?
‪Do you see it?

2285
01:39:59,159 --> 01:40:00,327
‪My wrist hurts.

2286
01:40:00,411 --> 01:40:01,954
‪My wrist hurts because of you.

2287
01:40:02,037 --> 01:40:02,913
‪Why?

2288
01:40:04,540 --> 01:40:06,875
‪-Are you trying to be king?
‪-I don't know.

2289
01:40:09,211 --> 01:40:10,838
‪You worked hard to be king, didn't you?

2290
01:40:10,921 --> 01:40:13,382
‪No, I don't know.

2291
01:40:15,843 --> 01:40:16,969
‪How was last night?

2292
01:40:17,052 --> 01:40:19,054
‪The beds in the tent were very close.

2293
01:40:19,138 --> 01:40:20,889
‪We talked about this and that,

2294
01:40:20,973 --> 01:40:22,266
‪and then, I went to sleep first.

2295
01:40:24,101 --> 01:40:25,144
‪What?

2296
01:40:25,227 --> 01:40:26,103
‪Nothing.

2297
01:40:27,604 --> 01:40:29,690
‪When I ran into Do-geon,

2298
01:40:29,773 --> 01:40:31,608
‪I felt my heart skip a beat.

2299
01:40:31,692 --> 01:40:32,818
‪Is it because he's tall?

2300
01:40:32,901 --> 01:40:36,196
‪When I see someone tall like you,
‪it fascinates me.

2301
01:40:36,989 --> 01:40:39,366
‪You were with
‪someone taller than me today.

2302
01:40:40,993 --> 01:40:41,827
‪I did.

2303
01:40:42,453 --> 01:40:44,037
‪-I did.
‪-You did.

2304
01:40:50,669 --> 01:40:52,921
‪MEANWHILE, YE-RIM IS ALONE

2305
01:40:53,630 --> 01:40:55,174
<i>‪I wondered when</i>
<i>‪Kyung-ho and Ga-yeon would be back.</i>

2306
01:40:55,257 --> 01:40:56,967
‪I wondered what kind of relationship

2307
01:40:57,718 --> 01:40:58,969
‪they would be in now.

2308
01:40:59,052 --> 01:41:01,263
‪I was worried
‪about how much their feelings developed

2309
01:41:01,346 --> 01:41:03,098
‪and how much they've shared.

2310
01:41:03,640 --> 01:41:04,808
‪When will they get back?

2311
01:41:04,892 --> 01:41:06,351
‪So what if they come back?

2312
01:41:06,435 --> 01:41:07,603
‪"Did you have fun?"

2313
01:41:07,686 --> 01:41:09,813
‪What do you think I should say?

2314
01:41:10,481 --> 01:41:12,983
‪"Did you have fun?"
‪sounds too confrontational, no?

2315
01:41:17,780 --> 01:41:19,323
‪SHE SEES KYUNG-HO'S REFLECTION

2316
01:41:19,406 --> 01:41:20,407
‪He's back.

2317
01:41:21,658 --> 01:41:23,285
‪Let's pretend we're having a fun chat.

2318
01:41:23,368 --> 01:41:24,453
‪Gosh.

2319
01:41:29,082 --> 01:41:31,752
‪-Did you have fun? Just got back?
‪-Yeah.

2320
01:41:32,753 --> 01:41:34,004
‪-You got back very late.
‪-Yeah.

2321
01:41:34,087 --> 01:41:36,089
‪Did you go far?

2322
01:41:36,173 --> 01:41:37,925
‪We did go far.

2323
01:41:38,008 --> 01:41:39,009
‪-I see.
‪-Yeah.

2324
01:41:47,601 --> 01:41:48,852
‪-You're back.
‪-Yeah.

2325
01:41:49,561 --> 01:41:51,605
‪-How was it?
‪-I'm exhausted.

2326
01:41:59,404 --> 01:42:01,198
‪-How was it, Kyung-ho?
‪-Me? I had fun.

2327
01:42:01,281 --> 01:42:02,491
‪I had fun. Yeah.

2328
01:42:02,574 --> 01:42:04,993
‪Was there a change of heart?

2329
01:42:05,077 --> 01:42:06,245
‪Me?

2330
01:42:06,328 --> 01:42:07,579
‪Of course.

2331
01:42:08,205 --> 01:42:09,706
‪I think things have become clear.

2332
01:42:10,415 --> 01:42:12,543
‪If I told you, you'd tell Ye-rim, right?

2333
01:42:12,626 --> 01:42:14,336
‪What do you mean?

2334
01:42:14,419 --> 01:42:15,921
‪Maybe not? Is it just my assumption?

2335
01:42:16,004 --> 01:42:17,965
‪I'm afraid you're secret allies.

2336
01:42:18,048 --> 01:42:19,591
‪It doesn't matter if she finds out.

2337
01:42:19,675 --> 01:42:21,802
‪What I wanted to do

2338
01:42:21,885 --> 01:42:26,682
‪was sort out my feelings for Ga-yeon.

2339
01:42:26,765 --> 01:42:30,936
‪I mean, I wanted clarity
‪on how I feel about her.

2340
01:42:31,019 --> 01:42:32,437
‪I got clarity for sure.

2341
01:42:33,522 --> 01:42:35,858
‪And with a little more time,
‪it'll become even clearer.

2342
01:42:35,941 --> 01:42:38,402
‪Also, I plan on talking with Ye-rim
‪one more time

2343
01:42:38,485 --> 01:42:42,656
‪and with Ga-yeon too, if we have time.

2344
01:42:42,739 --> 01:42:43,615
‪Today?

2345
01:42:44,533 --> 01:42:46,159
‪I think so.

2346
01:42:46,243 --> 01:42:48,745
‪Things will become more certain
‪for everyone tomorrow.

2347
01:42:48,829 --> 01:42:50,998
‪It may become certain for some,
‪and not for others,

2348
01:42:51,081 --> 01:42:53,917
‪but I think it will for me pretty soon.

2349
01:42:55,168 --> 01:42:56,211
‪AFTER THEIR CONVERSATION ENDS

2350
01:42:56,295 --> 01:42:57,170
‪-Oh, you're back.
‪-Hi.

2351
01:42:57,254 --> 01:42:58,755
‪Hi there.

2352
01:43:02,217 --> 01:43:03,677
‪YE-RIM COMES TO SEE DO-GEON IMMEDIATELY

2353
01:43:03,760 --> 01:43:04,928
‪Which one's mine?

2354
01:43:05,512 --> 01:43:07,514
‪I heard him out a bit.

2355
01:43:12,603 --> 01:43:13,979
‪Stop dilly-dallying.

2356
01:43:14,062 --> 01:43:16,356
‪I haven't heard it quite clearly either.

2357
01:43:16,440 --> 01:43:17,274
‪ANOTHER PERSON IS LISTENING

2358
01:43:17,357 --> 01:43:20,611
‪I think you may have a chance too.

2359
01:43:20,694 --> 01:43:23,280
‪-Do a good job of charming him.
‪-What did he say?

2360
01:43:23,363 --> 01:43:24,740
‪Well,

2361
01:43:24,823 --> 01:43:27,618
‪-he was very ambiguous.
‪-What did he say?

2362
01:43:28,243 --> 01:43:30,996
‪He said he asked Ga-yeon out on a date

2363
01:43:31,079 --> 01:43:34,333
‪because he was curious,

2364
01:43:35,792 --> 01:43:37,628
‪not because he has
‪strong feelings for her.

2365
01:43:39,546 --> 01:43:42,215
‪He thought his mind will be made up
‪after talking with her today.

2366
01:43:42,841 --> 01:43:44,885
‪But he said he'll have a chat
‪with both of you today.

2367
01:43:44,968 --> 01:43:46,845
‪With me and Ga-yeon?

2368
01:43:46,929 --> 01:43:51,224
‪But he said his mind is
‪pretty much made up already.

2369
01:43:51,308 --> 01:43:53,518
‪I think you have a better chance.

2370
01:43:53,602 --> 01:43:55,729
‪I'm so proud of you, Do-geon.

2371
01:43:55,812 --> 01:43:57,314
‪Try to win him over

2372
01:43:58,023 --> 01:43:59,608
‪when you talk with him.

2373
01:43:59,691 --> 01:44:03,445
‪Do-geon said that it could be me,

2374
01:44:04,029 --> 01:44:06,239
<i>‪so I was honestly feeling very happy.</i>

2375
01:44:06,323 --> 01:44:08,367
‪I'm just saying you have a shot.

2376
01:44:08,450 --> 01:44:09,618
‪Thank you so much.

2377
01:44:11,870 --> 01:44:14,289
‪Man, this is driving me crazy.

2378
01:44:14,373 --> 01:44:15,707
‪Just sit still!

2379
01:44:15,791 --> 01:44:17,626
‪How can the wires get crossed like this?

2380
01:44:17,709 --> 01:44:23,966
‪I think what Kyung-ho meant is
‪that he'll talk to Ye-rim to end things.

2381
01:44:24,049 --> 01:44:25,842
‪Ye-rim is too fickle too.

2382
01:44:26,426 --> 01:44:27,636
‪Just because she heard that, she goes…

2383
01:44:29,638 --> 01:44:31,139
‪I get it, though.

2384
01:44:31,223 --> 01:44:32,599
‪-Is this mine?
‪-Yeah.

2385
01:44:34,226 --> 01:44:35,268
‪Let's clink our glasses.

2386
01:44:36,478 --> 01:44:37,813
‪Cheers.

2387
01:44:41,692 --> 01:44:43,026
‪-Isn't it good?
‪-Yeah.

2388
01:44:43,110 --> 01:44:45,112
‪What did you have for dinner?

2389
01:44:45,195 --> 01:44:46,446
‪Grilled shellfish and raw fish.

2390
01:44:46,530 --> 01:44:47,781
‪That must've been good.

2391
01:44:47,864 --> 01:44:50,158
‪-Ours was good too.
‪-Yeah, it was.

2392
01:44:51,743 --> 01:44:52,786
‪The barbecue was good too.

2393
01:44:53,745 --> 01:44:55,872
<i>‪If everyone enjoyed their date,</i>

2394
01:44:56,498 --> 01:44:58,667
<i>‪the king is happy.</i>

2395
01:44:58,750 --> 01:45:00,043
‪Time to be dethroned.

2396
01:45:01,461 --> 01:45:02,462
‪I liked it too.

2397
01:45:03,088 --> 01:45:04,006
‪To be by the king.

2398
01:45:04,089 --> 01:45:06,133
‪-I liked being close to power.
‪-How nice for him.

2399
01:45:06,216 --> 01:45:07,175
‪Like a scheming advisor?

2400
01:45:07,259 --> 01:45:09,886
‪Yeah, like a scheming advisor.

2401
01:45:09,970 --> 01:45:11,346
‪The mudflat was nice too.

2402
01:45:11,430 --> 01:45:13,473
‪Chae-rin used the hoe like this.

2403
01:45:14,766 --> 01:45:15,934
‪Pow!

2404
01:45:16,018 --> 01:45:18,061
‪Then, the blood would…
‪Wait, not the blood.

2405
01:45:18,895 --> 01:45:19,855
‪It's a mudflat.

2406
01:45:19,938 --> 01:45:21,314
‪Did you only dig up shellfish?

2407
01:45:21,898 --> 01:45:24,109
‪-We didn't dig up love.
‪-Oh, how sad.

2408
01:45:25,444 --> 01:45:26,570
‪I see.

2409
01:45:30,198 --> 01:45:31,158
‪We have to go together.

2410
01:45:31,241 --> 01:45:32,659
‪-We have to go now.
‪-Yeah.

2411
01:45:32,743 --> 01:45:33,827
‪-Go where?
‪-Where?

2412
01:45:33,910 --> 01:45:35,203
‪Only the male tenants.

2413
01:45:35,287 --> 01:45:36,997
‪THE MEN'S DAY 3 HEART CHIP VOTE BEGINS

2414
01:45:37,080 --> 01:45:39,666
‪PARK JUNG-MIN
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2415
01:45:39,750 --> 01:45:42,169
<i>‪Multiple votes are allowed again today,</i>

2416
01:45:42,252 --> 01:45:45,756
<i>‪and Black Heart Chips</i>
<i>‪can be exchanged for Heart Chips.</i>

2417
01:45:50,135 --> 01:45:51,636
<i>‪Since I lost the bet…</i>

2418
01:45:51,720 --> 01:45:53,138
‪I did briefly think of

2419
01:45:53,805 --> 01:45:55,140
‪betraying her,

2420
01:45:55,223 --> 01:45:56,600
<i>‪but I gave them to her in the end.</i>

2421
01:45:57,392 --> 01:45:58,894
<i>‪I accepted my defeat</i>

2422
01:45:58,977 --> 01:46:00,353
<i>‪and gave her exactly 63 hearts.</i>

2423
01:46:00,437 --> 01:46:03,774
‪I hope Ga-yeon becomes king.

2424
01:46:03,857 --> 01:46:05,025
‪Why?

2425
01:46:05,108 --> 01:46:06,443
‪When we talked today…

2426
01:46:07,611 --> 01:46:09,821
‪Well, I can't share more.
‪It's about Ga-yeon's feelings.

2427
01:46:09,905 --> 01:46:11,615
‪Anyway, I hope she becomes king.

2428
01:46:12,616 --> 01:46:15,368
‪JUNG-MIN IS WRITING ANOTHER MESSAGE

2429
01:46:21,917 --> 01:46:24,544
<i>‪I wrote, "I'm rooting for the king"</i>

2430
01:46:24,628 --> 01:46:26,171
<i>‪and put it in her box</i>

2431
01:46:26,254 --> 01:46:28,590
<i>‪because I felt like Ga-yeon</i>
<i>‪would become king.</i>

2432
01:46:30,342 --> 01:46:33,637
‪PARK JUNG-MIN COMPLETED VOTING
‪63 TO CHAE-RIN, 16 TO GA-YEON

2433
01:46:33,720 --> 01:46:35,180
‪Did you have fun, Ga-yeon?

2434
01:46:35,972 --> 01:46:36,848
‪What did you do?

2435
01:46:37,516 --> 01:46:40,143
‪We went to a cafe.
‪Then, we had grilled shellfish.

2436
01:46:40,227 --> 01:46:42,479
‪Why did it take so long?
‪You guys were the last to come.

2437
01:46:43,855 --> 01:46:45,315
‪Your hand is a mess.

2438
01:46:53,782 --> 01:46:55,033
‪Tomorrow's date?

2439
01:46:55,117 --> 01:46:56,868
‪I'd love to go out.

2440
01:46:56,952 --> 01:46:58,662
‪There's someone I want to go out with too.

2441
01:46:58,745 --> 01:47:00,247
‪You know who you want to go out with?

2442
01:47:00,330 --> 01:47:01,915
‪-Who I want to go out with?
‪-Yeah.

2443
01:47:01,998 --> 01:47:04,126
‪Yeah, but it's a secret.

2444
01:47:05,377 --> 01:47:08,171
‪JUNG HA-YOON
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2445
01:47:08,797 --> 01:47:11,925
<i>‪My mind is pretty set.</i>

2446
01:47:12,008 --> 01:47:15,595
‪WE TALKED A LOT AND I GOT TO LEARN MORE
‪ABOUT YOU ON OUR DATE. THANK YOU

2447
01:47:15,679 --> 01:47:17,973
‪HA-YOON GAVE HYE-WON 66 HEARTS

2448
01:47:18,723 --> 01:47:21,643
‪JUNG HA-YOON COMPLETED VOTING
‪66 HEARTS TO HYE-WON

2449
01:47:21,726 --> 01:47:23,979
‪PARK DO-GEON
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2450
01:47:25,438 --> 01:47:28,483
‪HE EXCHANGED THEM WITH BLACK HEART CHIPS

2451
01:47:29,067 --> 01:47:30,944
<i>‪I wanted to help Ye-rim.</i>

2452
01:47:31,027 --> 01:47:32,904
<i>‪If Kyung-ho becomes king,</i>

2453
01:47:32,988 --> 01:47:36,408
<i>‪he would take Ga-yeon on a date,</i>

2454
01:47:36,491 --> 01:47:40,912
<i>‪so I gave him the Black Heart Chips</i>
<i>‪to eliminate that possibility.</i>

2455
01:47:42,873 --> 01:47:45,667
‪I gave my Heart Chips to Chae-rin.

2456
01:47:50,505 --> 01:47:52,007
‪YES, I WAS HERE

2457
01:47:52,090 --> 01:47:55,010
<i>‪I thought that the "Yes" on the note</i>
<i>‪from the second day</i>

2458
01:47:55,093 --> 01:47:56,928
<i>‪was from Chae-rin.</i>

2459
01:47:57,846 --> 01:48:01,892
‪PARK DO-GEON COMPLETED VOTING
‪24 TO CHAE-RIN, 23 BLACK TO KYUNG-HO

2460
01:48:02,475 --> 01:48:03,560
‪Why did it take so long?

2461
01:48:03,643 --> 01:48:04,811
‪I was thinking it over.

2462
01:48:04,895 --> 01:48:06,271
‪Really?

2463
01:48:07,147 --> 01:48:08,940
‪Man, I was so torn.

2464
01:48:09,024 --> 01:48:10,859
‪Were you thinking
‪about how much to give me?

2465
01:48:10,942 --> 01:48:12,611
‪What did you say?

2466
01:48:13,695 --> 01:48:15,697
‪-What?
‪-Nothing.

2467
01:48:15,780 --> 01:48:18,491
‪Who did you vote for?

2468
01:48:18,575 --> 01:48:19,576
‪Can you not tell me?

2469
01:48:20,202 --> 01:48:21,995
‪I don't have many hearts left.

2470
01:48:24,206 --> 01:48:25,916
‪I used up too many yesterday.

2471
01:48:25,999 --> 01:48:27,626
‪I'd better use a lot today.

2472
01:48:30,212 --> 01:48:31,254
‪My hands are cold.

2473
01:48:35,383 --> 01:48:37,552
‪She feels uneasy.

2474
01:48:37,636 --> 01:48:38,929
‪-Ga-yeon feels uneasy.
‪-Yeah.

2475
01:48:39,012 --> 01:48:40,847
‪She has a lot on her mind right now.

2476
01:48:43,099 --> 01:48:44,226
‪How is it so cold?

2477
01:48:45,477 --> 01:48:46,686
‪It's because I was outside.

2478
01:48:47,938 --> 01:48:49,606
‪How is it? Aren't I like a hand warmer?

2479
01:48:50,398 --> 01:48:51,650
‪I run hot.

2480
01:48:52,901 --> 01:48:54,903
‪KANG KYUNG-HO
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2481
01:48:57,948 --> 01:48:59,449
‪How many do I have?

2482
01:49:05,997 --> 01:49:08,083
<i>‪I put them in Ga-yeon's box.</i>

2483
01:49:08,166 --> 01:49:10,585
<i>‪It was a very huge number for me.</i>

2484
01:49:11,461 --> 01:49:15,966
<i>‪It meant, "I had fun today. This is</i>
<i>‪how strong my feelings for you are."</i>

2485
01:49:16,049 --> 01:49:17,592
<i>‪But it also meant,</i>

2486
01:49:17,676 --> 01:49:20,345
<i>‪"I hope you become king."</i>

2487
01:49:20,929 --> 01:49:23,515
<i>‪The king can do whatever they like.</i>

2488
01:49:24,849 --> 01:49:28,979
<i>‪I was hoping she could do</i>
<i>‪what she wants in the end.</i>

2489
01:49:29,562 --> 01:49:31,022
<i>‪That's why I did it.</i>

2490
01:49:31,940 --> 01:49:35,068
‪HE IS IN DEEP THOUGHT
‪AFTER VOTING FOR GA-YEON

2491
01:49:45,787 --> 01:49:49,958
‪KANG KYUNG-HO COMPLETED VOTING
‪???

2492
01:49:50,041 --> 01:49:52,877
‪THEY ARE BUSY PLAYING GONGGI

2493
01:49:55,672 --> 01:49:56,506
‪He's back.

2494
01:49:56,589 --> 01:49:58,425
‪-You took a very long time.
‪-Why did it take so long?

2495
01:49:58,508 --> 01:49:59,342
‪I'm cold.

2496
01:50:00,302 --> 01:50:02,762
‪THE FEMALE TENANTS MAY COME OUT
‪AND ENTER THE HEART ROOM NOW

2497
01:50:02,846 --> 01:50:04,097
‪-Let's go.
‪-Wait for me.

2498
01:50:04,180 --> 01:50:05,348
‪You should get changed.

2499
01:50:05,432 --> 01:50:06,558
‪I can't.

2500
01:50:08,643 --> 01:50:10,186
‪Then, wear this at least.

2501
01:50:10,270 --> 01:50:12,063
‪-Like this.
‪-I'll wear this.

2502
01:50:12,147 --> 01:50:13,315
‪Do you have a puffer jacket?

2503
01:50:13,398 --> 01:50:15,275
‪I think I can just wrap this around me.

2504
01:50:19,070 --> 01:50:20,113
‪It's over there.

2505
01:50:20,196 --> 01:50:22,365
‪GA-YEON WRAPS
‪KYUNG-HO'S JACKET AROUND HER WAIST

2506
01:50:22,449 --> 01:50:23,366
‪Did the rule change?

2507
01:50:23,450 --> 01:50:25,243
‪We aren't going one by one.

2508
01:50:27,954 --> 01:50:31,124
‪MOON CHAE-RIN
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2509
01:50:37,213 --> 01:50:43,470
<i>‪Because I realized the Heart Chips</i>
<i>‪aren't just for expressing my feelings,</i>

2510
01:50:44,054 --> 01:50:47,265
‪how I use them became
‪all the more important.

2511
01:50:47,349 --> 01:50:50,101
‪We keep encountering
‪unexpected turn of events,

2512
01:50:50,185 --> 01:50:52,896
‪so I wondered if there may come a time

2513
01:50:52,979 --> 01:50:54,981
‪where I have to use a lot of Heart Chips.

2514
01:50:55,065 --> 01:50:58,109
‪TIME TO GO ON A DATE WITH ME

2515
01:50:58,193 --> 01:50:59,569
<i>‪That's why I only used one.</i>

2516
01:51:00,653 --> 01:51:02,238
<i>‪Since I did have to express how I felt.</i>

2517
01:51:04,032 --> 01:51:07,202
‪MOON CHAE-RIN COMPLETED VOTING
‪ONE HEART TO DO-GEON

2518
01:51:07,285 --> 01:51:09,913
‪JUNG HYE-WON
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2519
01:51:15,335 --> 01:51:16,461
‪To Ha-yoon…

2520
01:51:17,921 --> 01:51:21,674
<i>‪Because he is the man</i>
<i>‪who made my day today…</i>

2521
01:51:21,758 --> 01:51:24,094
‪THANK YOU

2522
01:51:24,677 --> 01:51:27,972
‪JUNG HYE-WON COMPLETED VOTING
‪9 HEARTS TO HA-YOON

2523
01:51:28,056 --> 01:51:33,103
‪So far, my first choice hasn't changed.

2524
01:51:34,062 --> 01:51:36,523
‪I said I was confused whether

2525
01:51:36,606 --> 01:51:39,275
‪my feelings for Kyung-ho
‪were romantic or platonic, right?

2526
01:51:39,359 --> 01:51:40,902
‪I think it's romantic.

2527
01:51:42,237 --> 01:51:43,780
‪-You got to confirm it.
‪-My head hurts more.

2528
01:51:43,863 --> 01:51:47,617
‪-I think it'll get harder for me.
‪-Did you have a headache all day?

2529
01:51:47,700 --> 01:51:49,285
‪But so far, it's still Jung-min.

2530
01:51:50,328 --> 01:51:51,830
‪Who makes your heart flutter more?

2531
01:51:51,913 --> 01:51:52,914
‪I'm sure it's Kyung-ho.

2532
01:51:52,997 --> 01:51:53,915
‪No? Sorry.

2533
01:51:53,998 --> 01:51:57,377
‪I think it's still Jung-min.

2534
01:51:57,460 --> 01:52:00,964
‪But I haven't even
‪gone on a date with Jung-min yet.

2535
01:52:01,047 --> 01:52:03,883
‪I'll know when I go on a date
‪with Jung-min.

2536
01:52:03,967 --> 01:52:06,136
‪That's when my feelings will become clear.

2537
01:52:06,219 --> 01:52:08,888
‪Then, I should tell one of them
‪as soon as I figure it out.

2538
01:52:09,514 --> 01:52:10,974
‪I'd have to tell them who my choice is.

2539
01:52:11,057 --> 01:52:13,601
‪She makes it seem like
‪she decided on Jung-min,

2540
01:52:13,685 --> 01:52:16,396
‪but things keep happening with Kyung-ho.

2541
01:52:16,479 --> 01:52:21,151
‪It seems like she admitted
‪that she has romantic feelings for him.

2542
01:52:21,234 --> 01:52:23,153
‪Kyung-ho is practically her first choice.

2543
01:52:23,236 --> 01:52:26,156
‪If I were Jung-min,
‪I would be so disappointed in her.

2544
01:52:26,990 --> 01:52:30,535
‪But when you think about it,
‪Ga-yeon did nothing wrong.

2545
01:52:32,829 --> 01:52:34,122
‪Wait.

2546
01:52:34,205 --> 01:52:37,083
‪-She didn't do anything wrong, but…
‪-When I think about it,

2547
01:52:37,167 --> 01:52:38,960
‪she didn't do anything wrong.

2548
01:52:39,043 --> 01:52:41,212
‪-She didn't do anything wrong, but…
‪-Yeah.

2549
01:52:41,296 --> 01:52:44,591
‪I think Ga-yeon is sincere
‪about Jung-min too.

2550
01:52:45,175 --> 01:52:46,801
‪I don't know. This is hard.

2551
01:52:46,885 --> 01:52:48,219
‪-Let's watch.
‪-Yeah, let's watch.

2552
01:52:49,804 --> 01:52:53,725
‪PARK GA-YEON
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2553
01:52:56,478 --> 01:52:58,897
‪LET'S HAVE FUN TOMORROW

2554
01:53:02,525 --> 01:53:05,695
‪I HAD FUN TODAY!

2555
01:53:18,666 --> 01:53:22,253
<i>‪I wanted to go on a date with him,</i>

2556
01:53:22,962 --> 01:53:25,590
<i>‪so I thought we can go on our date</i>
<i>‪if I make Jung-min king.</i>

2557
01:53:26,716 --> 01:53:29,302
‪GA-YEON GAVE JUNG-MIN
‪163 HEARTS

2558
01:53:29,886 --> 01:53:31,804
<i>‪And since I had fun</i>
<i>‪on my date with Kyung-ho,</i>

2559
01:53:31,888 --> 01:53:33,431
<i>‪I made that known to him.</i>

2560
01:53:37,060 --> 01:53:40,355
‪PARK GA-YEON COMPLETED VOTING
‪163 TO JUNG-MIN, 6 TO KYUNG-HO

2561
01:53:42,232 --> 01:53:43,399
‪She gave 163.

2562
01:53:43,483 --> 01:53:46,152
‪That's her sealing the deal.

2563
01:53:46,236 --> 01:53:49,447
‪LEE YE-RIM
‪ENTERS THE HEART ROOM

2564
01:53:50,031 --> 01:53:53,243
‪SHE HAS THE UNUSED 10 BLACK HEART CHIPS
‪FROM YESTERDAY

2565
01:53:58,248 --> 01:54:00,667
<i>‪I gave all the black ones I had left</i>
<i>‪into Ga-yeon's box.</i>

2566
01:54:01,751 --> 01:54:04,671
‪YE-RIM GAVE KYUNG-HO
‪11 HEARTS

2567
01:54:06,923 --> 01:54:11,261
‪LEE YE-RIM COMPLETED VOTING
‪11 TO KYUNG-HO, 10 BLACK HEARTS TO GA-YEON

2568
01:54:12,428 --> 01:54:15,598
<i>‪The Heart Chip vote</i>
<i>‪for the third day has ended.</i>

2569
01:54:16,099 --> 01:54:18,184
‪YE-RIM CAME TO SEE DO-GEON AFTER VOTING

2570
01:54:18,268 --> 01:54:19,978
‪He went to change his pants.

2571
01:54:20,061 --> 01:54:21,437
‪Talk to him when he comes out.

2572
01:54:21,521 --> 01:54:23,856
‪Talk to him before the results are out?

2573
01:54:23,940 --> 01:54:27,068
‪Talking to him after the results are out
‪won't make any difference, will it?

2574
01:54:27,151 --> 01:54:28,611
‪-You know, I want…
‪-Already--

2575
01:54:28,695 --> 01:54:31,322
‪I want him to want me.

2576
01:54:35,535 --> 01:54:36,911
‪Oh, no.

2577
01:54:37,495 --> 01:54:39,163
‪Is it her age that's the issue?

2578
01:54:39,247 --> 01:54:42,208
‪I think her age and lack of experience
‪are the issue.

2579
01:54:42,292 --> 01:54:45,336
‪They have to be on a similar page
‪for sparks to fly.

2580
01:54:45,420 --> 01:54:48,798
‪Ga-yeon and Kyung-ho have that.
‪That's why they enjoy each other.

2581
01:54:48,882 --> 01:54:50,633
‪That was a great insight, Joo-heon.

2582
01:54:50,717 --> 01:54:52,051
‪-They enjoy each other's company.
‪-Yeah.

2583
01:54:52,135 --> 01:54:54,012
‪But Ye-rim keeps dampening the mood.

2584
01:54:54,095 --> 01:54:56,389
‪He said he was going to talk with you.

2585
01:54:56,472 --> 01:55:00,143
‪Then, I'll wait with you looking bored.

2586
01:55:00,226 --> 01:55:02,353
‪Glance over

2587
01:55:02,437 --> 01:55:04,022
‪-and try to make eye contact.
‪-Okay.

2588
01:55:04,105 --> 01:55:05,773
‪-Good.
‪-Okay.

2589
01:55:09,569 --> 01:55:11,863
‪-Who wants to see the Big Dipper outside?
‪-Me.

2590
01:55:11,946 --> 01:55:13,156
‪Let's go.

2591
01:55:14,240 --> 01:55:15,992
‪I found the Big Dipper.

2592
01:55:16,075 --> 01:55:17,368
‪-You did?
‪-Yeah.

2593
01:55:18,286 --> 01:55:19,329
‪Is it visible right now?

2594
01:55:19,954 --> 01:55:21,039
‪It was right here.

2595
01:55:21,122 --> 01:55:21,998
‪I found it.

2596
01:55:22,081 --> 01:55:23,541
‪-You found it?
‪-It's right there.

2597
01:55:23,625 --> 01:55:24,459
‪-Right?
‪-Yeah.

2598
01:55:32,800 --> 01:55:33,801
‪What is this?

2599
01:55:35,219 --> 01:55:36,804
‪I don't know.

2600
01:55:36,888 --> 01:55:37,972
‪Are you getting sick of this?

2601
01:55:38,056 --> 01:55:40,266
‪No, I'm not.

2602
01:55:40,350 --> 01:55:42,352
‪-I really don't know.
‪-I'm sorry.

2603
01:55:42,435 --> 01:55:44,437
‪You don't have to apologize.

2604
01:55:44,520 --> 01:55:46,898
‪Didn't it feel like
‪he was deliberately avoiding me?

2605
01:55:46,981 --> 01:55:49,734
‪-He may be doing it deliberately.
‪-Yeah.

2606
01:55:49,817 --> 01:55:51,736
‪He hasn't made eye contact with me at all.

2607
01:55:57,450 --> 01:55:58,409
‪Oops.

2608
01:56:02,121 --> 01:56:05,291
‪Why is she making that sad face?

2609
01:56:07,835 --> 01:56:08,962
‪This is her the whole time.

2610
01:56:11,005 --> 01:56:12,715
‪Gosh. You know,

2611
01:56:12,799 --> 01:56:15,093
‪I'm watching with a heavy heart
‪because she's like my past self.

2612
01:56:15,760 --> 01:56:16,970
‪It's so deflating.

2613
01:56:17,637 --> 01:56:20,223
‪Be confident. Please!

2614
01:56:20,306 --> 01:56:23,309
‪When your feelings aren't reciprocated,

2615
01:56:23,393 --> 01:56:25,186
‪you end up reading too much
‪into that person

2616
01:56:25,269 --> 01:56:28,940
‪and painting them as the bad person.

2617
01:56:29,649 --> 01:56:32,777
‪It’s embarrassing
‪because I see so much of myself in her.

2618
01:56:33,778 --> 01:56:34,862
‪It's hard for me even now.

2619
01:56:39,409 --> 01:56:42,161
<i>‪Moments ago, your Heart Chip votes</i>

2620
01:56:42,245 --> 01:56:44,831
<i>‪crowned the third king.</i>

2621
01:56:44,914 --> 01:56:47,458
<i>‪Please congratulate them</i>
<i>‪with a round of applause.</i>

2622
01:56:52,672 --> 01:56:54,424
‪We aren't checking the results?

2623
01:56:54,507 --> 01:56:55,633
‪Will they tell us tomorrow?

2624
01:56:58,219 --> 01:57:00,179
<i>‪The third king is…</i>

2625
01:57:00,263 --> 01:57:01,514
‪All right, Jung-min.

2626
01:57:01,597 --> 01:57:03,099
‪Let's go, Jung-min.

2627
01:57:04,308 --> 01:57:06,269
<i>‪The third king is</i>

2628
01:57:06,352 --> 01:57:07,603
<i>‪Park Do-geon.</i>

2629
01:57:08,104 --> 01:57:10,398
<i>‪It's Park Do-geon.</i>

2630
01:57:17,405 --> 01:57:19,323
‪-But she put in one. What?
‪-How?

2631
01:57:19,407 --> 01:57:21,200
‪I don't understand.
‪Chae-rin only gave one.

2632
01:57:21,284 --> 01:57:22,660
‪Wait.

2633
01:57:22,744 --> 01:57:24,495
‪Wait. I'm getting scared.

2634
01:57:24,579 --> 01:57:26,247
‪What did Ye-rim do?

2635
01:57:27,331 --> 01:57:29,333
<i>‪The third king is</i>

2636
01:57:29,417 --> 01:57:31,002
<i>‪Park Do-geon.</i>

2637
01:57:31,085 --> 01:57:33,421
<i>‪It's Park Do-geon.</i>

2638
01:57:34,172 --> 01:57:35,089
‪How?

2639
01:57:35,173 --> 01:57:38,301
<i>‪We combined the total of the Heart Chips</i>
<i>‪and Black Heart Chips,</i>

2640
01:57:38,384 --> 01:57:42,346
<i>‪and Park Do-geon has become</i>
<i>‪the third king.</i>

2641
01:57:42,972 --> 01:57:43,890
‪How did Do-geon…

2642
01:57:48,853 --> 01:57:50,646
‪-No way! Ye-rim?
‪-Ye-rim looked at him

2643
01:57:50,730 --> 01:57:51,731
‪and nodded.

2644
01:57:53,066 --> 01:57:54,442
‪EARLIER, DURING THE HEART CHIP VOTE

2645
01:57:55,818 --> 01:57:57,862
‪PARK DO-GEON, GONGGI

2646
01:58:08,915 --> 01:58:10,625
‪She put all of it in?

2647
01:58:10,708 --> 01:58:11,751
‪Did Ye-rim put all of it in?

2648
01:58:11,834 --> 01:58:13,211
‪Did Ye-rim put all of it in?

2649
01:58:14,337 --> 01:58:16,380
<i>‪I gave almost all of mine to Do-geon.</i>

2650
01:58:16,464 --> 01:58:19,133
‪The only tactic I can use now

2651
01:58:19,217 --> 01:58:21,803
‪is making you king.

2652
01:58:21,886 --> 01:58:23,554
‪SHE PLOTTED TO MAKE DO-GEON KING

2653
01:58:23,638 --> 01:58:25,848
‪I'm going to make Do-geon king.

2654
01:58:25,932 --> 01:58:27,600
‪Are you going to vote for Do-geon too?

2655
01:58:27,683 --> 01:58:28,893
‪-Yeah, I can do that.
‪-Yeah?

2656
01:58:28,976 --> 01:58:31,896
‪If you have the black ones, exchange them

2657
01:58:31,979 --> 01:58:33,731
‪and give them to Ga-yeon and Kyung-ho.

2658
01:58:34,482 --> 01:58:36,818
‪HA-YOON PUT 25 BLACK HEARTS EACH
‪TO GA-YEON AND KYUNG-HO

2659
01:58:37,401 --> 01:58:38,444
‪HYE-WON GAVE HEARTS TO DO-GEON TOO

2660
01:58:38,528 --> 01:58:40,947
‪We'll all make you king.

2661
01:58:41,030 --> 01:58:43,407
‪If Kyung-ho or Ga-yeon became king,

2662
01:58:43,491 --> 01:58:47,036
‪they would likely choose each other.

2663
01:58:47,120 --> 01:58:50,206
<i>‪I have to go on</i>
<i>‪the final date with Kyung-ho.</i>

2664
01:58:50,289 --> 01:58:53,918
<i>‪That's why I put so many Heart Chips</i>
<i>‪into Do-geon's box.</i>

2665
01:58:59,715 --> 01:59:01,259
‪YE-RIM GAVE DO-GEON
‪205 HEARTS

2666
01:59:01,342 --> 01:59:03,803
‪PARK DO-GEON: 205 FROM YE-RIM
‪1 FROM CHAE-RIN, 26 FROM HYE-WON

2667
01:59:03,886 --> 01:59:05,888
‪PARK DO-GEON
‪232 HEARTS

2668
01:59:05,972 --> 01:59:07,932
‪I finally got the power.

2669
01:59:12,812 --> 01:59:14,147
‪I got goosebumps.

2670
01:59:14,230 --> 01:59:15,940
‪Dynamite can come in small packages.

2671
01:59:16,023 --> 01:59:18,276
‪You're the substitute king.
‪I'm the real king.

2672
01:59:18,359 --> 01:59:20,695
<i>‪Did he have to put it that way?</i>

2673
01:59:21,320 --> 01:59:22,613
‪He was being sarcastic. "Substitute king."

2674
01:59:22,697 --> 01:59:25,867
‪-I left a little and put most in yours.
‪-Really?

2675
01:59:25,950 --> 01:59:27,243
‪Were the feelings bigger than you thought?

2676
01:59:27,326 --> 01:59:29,453
‪Maybe he's high on himself doing that.

2677
01:59:29,537 --> 01:59:32,790
<i>‪They act like they are</i>
<i>‪the only two people in the world.</i>

2678
01:59:32,874 --> 01:59:34,000
<i>‪It's annoying?</i>

2679
01:59:34,083 --> 01:59:35,793
<i>‪Man, things are going to blow up today.</i>

2680
01:59:35,877 --> 01:59:37,336
<i>‪It was such a headache.</i>

2681
01:59:37,420 --> 01:59:41,090
<i>‪I was jealous, but I didn't think</i>
<i>‪she would change her mind.</i>

2682
01:59:41,716 --> 01:59:46,095
‪The way you express how you feel
‪is so different from how Jung-min does it.

2683
01:59:46,179 --> 01:59:47,180
‪Come to me.

2684
01:59:47,263 --> 01:59:48,222
<i>‪Let's begin the game.</i>

2685
01:59:48,306 --> 01:59:50,057
<i>‪The rules of Love Marble.</i>

2686
01:59:50,141 --> 01:59:53,769
‪I'd like to know
‪who Ga-yeon's first choice is.

2687
01:59:58,816 --> 02:00:00,234
<i>‪What do I do?</i>

2688
02:00:01,360 --> 02:00:02,570
<i>‪What is the right thing to do?</i>

2689
02:00:10,453 --> 02:00:12,455
‪Subtitle translation by: Ilyoung Kim

2690
02:00:12,538 --> 02:00:15,416
‪THE LOVE LAB
